Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 170

Reference: GEN 1:7
Text: And God made the firmament, and divided the waters which were under the firmament from the waters which were above the firmament: and it was so.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/1/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8a6a5f78-4cbf-44d2-a0f2-d4e565643eb7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 115

Reference: GEN 1:8
Text: And God called the firmament Heaven. And the evening and the morning were the second day.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/1/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:22f37e65-8246-42e2-bb36-df257ac2897e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 152

Reference: GEN 1:9
Text: And God said, Let the waters under the heaven be gathered together unto one place, and let the dry land appear: and it was so.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/1/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1e9d9973-6465-4669-92c3-20d33795a854>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 148

Reference: GEN 1:10
Text: And God called the dry land Earth; and the gathering together of the waters called he Seas: and God saw that it was good.


WARC/1.0
