Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: GEN 1:15
Text: And let them be for lights in the firmament of the heaven to give light upon the earth: and it was so.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/1/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2d3c19c1-b767-45e2-b757-6199d3759aef>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 156

Reference: GEN 1:16
Text: And God made two great lights; the greater light to rule the day, and the lesser light to rule the night: he made the stars also.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/1/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
