Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 104

Reference: GEN 1:17
Text: And God set them in the firmament of the heaven to give light upon the earth,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/1/18
