Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: GEN 5:1
Text: This is the book of the generations of Adam. In the day that God created man, in the likeness of God made he him;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2ac79cf4-c4ce-47fc-bea3-c4ce2a6bca93>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: GEN 5:2
Text: Male and female created he them; and blessed them, and called their name Adam, in the day when they were created.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
