WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6ddde8c4-40af-4f15-88d8-d26a6e01db24>
Content-Type: text/plain
