Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: GEN 5:22
Text: And Enoch walked with God after he begat Methuselah three hundred years, and begat sons and daughters:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ce55f1cd-d818-44bf-a897-498ef8785f97>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 93

Reference: GEN 5:23
Text: And all the days of Enoch were three hundred sixty and five years:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2a3ecf20-c9e6-408a-9b5a-b1836305682f>
Content-Type: text/plain
