Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: GEN 5:26
Text: And Methuselah lived after he begat Lamech seven hundred eighty and two years, and begat sons and daughters:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
