Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 110

Reference: GEN 5:27
Text: And all the days of Methuselah were nine hundred sixty and nine years: and he died.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/5/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
