Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 104

Reference: GEN 9:19
Text: These are the three sons of Noah: and of them was the whole earth overspread.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/9/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cff9ebe2-63d9-48cb-b077-b06b09d66c68>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 89

Reference: GEN 9:20
Text: And Noah began to be an husbandman, and he planted a vineyard:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/9/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:380c5b78-68bb-476d-a3db-738ab4eaf8a4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 107

Reference: GEN 9:21
Text: And he drank of the wine, and was drunken; and he was uncovered within his tent.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/9/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:56914138-7103-4f3a-908f-a0f879189a4d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 125

Reference: GEN 9:22
Text: And Ham, the father of Canaan, saw the nakedness of his father, and told his two brethren without.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/9/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a3f6211c-1a01-4aec-8929-f31e501ef2f1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 240

Reference: GEN 9:23
Text: And Shem and Japheth took a garment, and laid it upon both their shoulders, and went backward, and covered the nakedness of their father; and their faces were backward, and they saw not their father’s nakedness.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/9/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
