Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 105

Reference: GEN 9:24
Text: And Noah awoke from his wine, and knew what his younger son had done unto him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/GEN/9/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
