Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: EXO 26:36
Text: And thou shalt make an hanging for the door of the tent, of blue, and purple, and scarlet, and fine twined linen, wrought with needlework.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/26/37
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6069eb1a-a1e9-49a3-b13b-0f2a6ab28f58>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 207

Reference: EXO 26:37
Text: And thou shalt make for the hanging five pillars of shittim wood, and overlay them with gold, and their hooks shall be of gold: and thou shalt cast five sockets of brass for them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e0b86c46-9740-44a9-8115-9dc7e932066e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 190

Reference: EXO 27:1
Text: And thou shalt make an altar of shittim wood, five cubits long, and five cubits broad; the altar shall be foursquare: and the height thereof shall be three cubits.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:12c93e61-d066-4540-975c-4819fca8921c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 163

Reference: EXO 27:2
Text: And thou shalt make the horns of it upon the four corners thereof: his horns shall be of the same: and thou shalt overlay it with brass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:97c20a0c-ef60-45cf-9504-7dc362418020>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 198

Reference: EXO 27:3
Text: And thou shalt make his pans to receive his ashes, and his shovels, and his basons, and his fleshhooks, and his firepans: all the vessels thereof thou shalt make of brass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cd1d9ce9-e553-46fb-afbb-ebf0368af7c0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 162

Reference: EXO 27:4
Text: And thou shalt make for it a grate of network of brass; and upon the net shalt thou make four brasen rings in the four corners thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:04494de2-55ea-4821-8ae7-367c28dfba02>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 140

Reference: EXO 27:5
Text: And thou shalt put it under the compass of the altar beneath, that the net may be even to the midst of the altar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:59fc5e6b-2597-4c8b-bffa-122909f3d14a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 121

Reference: EXO 27:6
Text: And thou shalt make staves for the altar, staves of shittim wood, and overlay them with brass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f0cb3be0-a2e3-4fd3-97fe-00de4c9f0685>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: EXO 27:7
Text: And the staves shall be put into the rings, and the staves shall be upon the two sides of the altar, to bear it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:dd2969d7-9b7e-4dd3-b70b-750bac81c2cd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 124

Reference: EXO 27:8
Text: Hollow with boards shalt thou make it: as it was shewed thee in the mount, so shall they make it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2e9dde73-fbec-4525-8d9a-16861965073b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 203

Reference: EXO 27:9
Text: And thou shalt make the court of the tabernacle: for the south side southward there shall be hangings for the court of fine twined linen of an hundred cubits long for one side:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cb09e48e-d7a3-4153-b78d-5c835aa98a97>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 165

Reference: EXO 27:10
Text: And the twenty pillars thereof and their twenty sockets shall be of brass; the hooks of the pillars and their fillets shall be of silver.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b918a4c1-2ba9-4ed0-bdb0-1e12872a357a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 232

Reference: EXO 27:11
Text: And likewise for the north side in length there shall be hangings of an hundred cubits long, and his twenty pillars and their twenty sockets of brass; the hooks of the pillars and their fillets of silver.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4a34da2f-02c8-40a6-a4a6-2e810266a080>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 154

Reference: EXO 27:12
Text: And for the breadth of the court on the west side shall be hangings of fifty cubits: their pillars ten, and their sockets ten.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:79bbdb1e-e540-4a0d-b737-530353613cd6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 105

Reference: EXO 27:13
Text: And the breadth of the court on the east side eastward shall be fifty cubits.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b8bf6a91-1a7c-4eb0-9129-67bdb9e065d4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: EXO 27:14
Text: The hangings of one side of the gate shall be fifteen cubits: their pillars three, and their sockets three.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c443a5b0-184d-4b67-aab3-5beb3eff6beb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: EXO 27:15
Text: And on the other side shall be hangings fifteen cubits: their pillars three, and their sockets three.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5d7aa6c2-0498-41f9-a89c-b2aa0231bd4e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 234

Reference: EXO 27:16
Text: And for the gate of the court shall be an hanging of twenty cubits, of blue, and purple, and scarlet, and fine twined linen, wrought with needlework: and their pillars shall be four, and their sockets four.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:20e7fc98-f9ea-40bd-8ad6-53b9a0125ba9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 156

Reference: EXO 27:17
Text: All the pillars round about the court shall be filleted with silver; their hooks shall be of silver, and their sockets of brass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8096ca0b-ff52-426c-b6d0-116f67b65b1c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 191

Reference: EXO 27:18
Text: The length of the court shall be an hundred cubits, and the breadth fifty every where, and the height five cubits of fine twined linen, and their sockets of brass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5552950f-4d01-4dcf-9c2d-b1d6fb9ea37c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 165

Reference: EXO 27:19
Text: All the vessels of the tabernacle in all the service thereof, and all the pins thereof, and all the pins of the court, shall be of brass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:02aeca33-272e-4a83-8a8d-b07c8a5800ee>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: EXO 27:20
Text: And thou shalt command the children of Israel, that they bring thee pure oil olive beaten for the light, to cause the lamp to burn always.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/27/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8f1108d5-5d63-49a7-bfd6-4e9d9fe17c5f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 284

Reference: EXO 27:21
Text: In the tabernacle of the congregation without the vail, which is before the testimony, Aaron and his sons shall order it from evening to morning before the LORD: it shall be a statute for ever unto their generations on the behalf of the children of Israel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:81888d94-ff7b-47bd-ba8a-4e0c039786e8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 248

Reference: EXO 28:1
Text: And take thou unto thee Aaron thy brother, and his sons with him, from among the children of Israel, that he may minister unto me in the priest’s office, even Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar, Aaron’s sons.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7bc91293-0b5f-4621-8b5b-6d63faff0a6e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 108

Reference: EXO 28:2
Text: And thou shalt make holy garments for Aaron thy brother for glory and for beauty.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ab7cf15a-7564-425f-8f9c-065bffb6cdbc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 237

Reference: EXO 28:3
Text: And thou shalt speak unto all that are wise hearted, whom I have filled with the spirit of wisdom, that they may make Aaron’s garments to consecrate him, that he may minister unto me in the priest’s office.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2ae7aa00-4aa3-45be-b423-873880425c35>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 288

Reference: EXO 28:4
Text: And these are the garments which they shall make; a breastplate, and an ephod, and a robe, and a broidered coat, a mitre, and a girdle: and they shall make holy garments for Aaron thy brother, and his sons, that he may minister unto me in the priest’s office.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4f7ea3a7-12a8-4632-ba59-7746dba21426>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 103

Reference: EXO 28:5
Text: And they shall take gold, and blue, and purple, and scarlet, and fine linen.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0a67ceed-ba39-48fc-9d99-202091334c70>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 143

Reference: EXO 28:6
Text: And they shall make the ephod of gold, of blue, and of purple, of scarlet, and fine twined linen, with cunning work.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:45e9a3b8-67a0-4103-b21a-1bcb51382753>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 140

Reference: EXO 28:7
Text: It shall have the two shoulderpieces thereof joined at the two edges thereof; and so it shall be joined together.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:01085d08-e7d3-4278-bb23-90826bbff5f9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 205

Reference: EXO 28:8
Text: And the curious girdle of the ephod, which is upon it, shall be of the same, according to the work thereof; even of gold, of blue, and purple, and scarlet, and fine twined linen.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c4c9a100-5232-40ca-bd05-6deb7188331a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 118

Reference: EXO 28:9
Text: And thou shalt take two onyx stones, and grave on them the names of the children of Israel:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:af2d112c-318f-42b0-bf4f-bba57dcee068>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 142

Reference: EXO 28:10
Text: Six of their names on one stone, and the other six names of the rest on the other stone, according to their birth.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e480d28a-0cfc-4856-a619-4cc72f6947c1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 225

Reference: EXO 28:11
Text: With the work of an engraver in stone, like the engravings of a signet, shalt thou engrave the two stones with the names of the children of Israel: thou shalt make them to be set in ouches of gold.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1ddaa502-5aae-4a16-861e-a8cbfe54e4f0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 233

Reference: EXO 28:12
Text: And thou shalt put the two stones upon the shoulders of the ephod for stones of memorial unto the children of Israel: and Aaron shall bear their names before the LORD upon his two shoulders for a memorial.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:13850a84-6891-4898-ba5e-34c3fca6d040>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 63

Reference: EXO 28:13
Text: And thou shalt make ouches of gold;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e132ca21-4a70-4baa-b53e-e382ad1e813e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 153

Reference: EXO 28:14
Text: And two chains of pure gold at the ends; of wreathen work shalt thou make them, and fasten the wreathen chains to the ouches.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d02ae054-746c-4f15-aab0-c838b8206fb0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 237

Reference: EXO 28:15
Text: And thou shalt make the breastplate of judgment with cunning work; after the work of the ephod thou shalt make it; of gold, of blue, and of purple, and of scarlet, and of fine twined linen, shalt thou make it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a35464db-c514-42b3-bfbb-6c31928838a1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 142

Reference: EXO 28:16
Text: Foursquare it shall be being doubled; a span shall be the length thereof, and a span shall be the breadth thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ebe4a315-7830-4d12-b957-2615e3575aa8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 187

Reference: EXO 28:17
Text: And thou shalt set in it settings of stones, even four rows of stones: the first row shall be a sardius, a topaz, and a carbuncle: this shall be the first row.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:91d92452-bc17-48aa-af10-454785246783>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 94

Reference: EXO 28:18
Text: And the second row shall be an emerald, a sapphire, and a diamond.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2b60a14a-8610-477a-8206-9632764c8689>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 82

Reference: EXO 28:19
Text: And the third row a ligure, an agate, and an amethyst.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d65d86a8-7712-4b4c-b17f-c75f6bbbef61>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: EXO 28:20
Text: And the fourth row a beryl, and an onyx, and a jasper: they shall be set in gold in their inclosings.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:33979871-e82e-4df7-8473-8a55cb45158a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 230

Reference: EXO 28:21
Text: And the stones shall be with the names of the children of Israel, twelve, according to their names, like the engravings of a signet; every one with his name shall they be according to the twelve tribes.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c670f874-308b-4135-8ce3-40693c62cc98>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 118

Reference: EXO 28:22
Text: And thou shalt make upon the breastplate chains at the ends of wreathen work of pure gold.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d965e729-0598-4544-b725-3e827ebf5ccf>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: EXO 28:23
Text: And thou shalt make upon the breastplate two rings of gold, and shalt put the two rings on the two ends of the breastplate.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:963ba651-c82c-44b9-bab9-603b003bbc30>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 137

Reference: EXO 28:24
Text: And thou shalt put the two wreathen chains of gold in the two rings which are on the ends of the breastplate.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1e786436-70fb-4c1e-81df-c41b81cf13fa>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 173

Reference: EXO 28:25
Text: And the other two ends of the two wreathen chains thou shalt fasten in the two ouches, and put them on the shoulderpieces of the ephod before it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
