Content-Length: 242

Reference: EXO 28:28
Text: And they shall bind the breastplate by the rings thereof unto the rings of the ephod with a lace of blue, that it may be above the curious girdle of the ephod, and that the breastplate be not loosed from the ephod.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cb8b19a8-3554-49cd-8f67-849b0ab78d48>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 213

Reference: EXO 28:29
Text: And Aaron shall bear the names of the children of Israel in the breastplate of judgment upon his heart, when he goeth in unto the holy place, for a memorial before the LORD continually.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0d4e8d00-ed99-4d0f-b055-5f6975fbd667>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 281

Reference: EXO 28:30
Text: And thou shalt put in the breastplate of judgment the Urim and the Thummim; and they shall be upon Aaron’s heart, when he goeth in before the LORD: and Aaron shall bear the judgment of the children of Israel upon his heart before the LORD continually.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:55112c46-c0ec-4a02-a2a6-56333661a269>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 82

Reference: EXO 28:31
Text: And thou shalt make the robe of the ephod all of blue.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c0974938-2303-48fe-b588-d3508071438f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 218

Reference: EXO 28:32
Text: And there shall be an hole in the top of it, in the midst thereof: it shall have a binding of woven work round about the hole of it, as it were the hole of an habergeon, that it be not rent.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b3bfc8ee-b809-4e5a-a8f0-d7d5ac35b247>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 200

Reference: EXO 28:33
Text: And beneath upon the hem of it thou shalt make pomegranates of blue, and of purple, and of scarlet, round about the hem thereof; and bells of gold between them round about:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a77a0ee8-a0b1-45ce-8202-ae904993a1a5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 131

Reference: EXO 28:34
Text: A golden bell and a pomegranate, a golden bell and a pomegranate, upon the hem of the robe round about.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/35
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c2be202e-76a9-468f-8d77-9bac342200ea>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 191

Reference: EXO 28:35
Text: And it shall be upon Aaron to minister: and his sound shall be heard when he goeth in unto the holy place before the LORD, and when he cometh out, that he die not.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/36
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:91e1916e-ae05-4358-8827-f09802cf89ee>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 143

Reference: EXO 28:36
Text: And thou shalt make a plate of pure gold, and grave upon it, like the engravings of a signet, HOLINESS TO THE LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/37
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b11e1b91-b990-4257-94e7-40946bbb4388>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 141

Reference: EXO 28:37
Text: And thou shalt put it on a blue lace, that it may be upon the mitre; upon the forefront of the mitre it shall be.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/38
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9ecad8b8-489d-4148-aec6-a8140598ee85>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 273

Reference: EXO 28:38
Text: And it shall be upon Aaron’s forehead, that Aaron may bear the iniquity of the holy things, which the children of Israel shall hallow in all their holy gifts; and it shall be always upon his forehead, that they may be accepted before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/39
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6ae5b336-fc75-4e83-93f1-219ebe627daf>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 167

Reference: EXO 28:39
Text: And thou shalt embroider the coat of fine linen, and thou shalt make the mitre of fine linen, and thou shalt make the girdle of needlework.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/40
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3c5435ad-a075-4d58-b6e1-623b77546eb7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 175

Reference: EXO 28:40
Text: And for Aaron’s sons thou shalt make coats, and thou shalt make for them girdles, and bonnets shalt thou make for them, for glory and for beauty.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/41
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:18aab1f0-1eb7-40ce-a4d3-4d10b0d2b74e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 218

Reference: EXO 28:41
Text: And thou shalt put them upon Aaron thy brother, and his sons with him; and shalt anoint them, and consecrate them, and sanctify them, that they may minister unto me in the priest’s office.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/42
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8991b384-46d9-427e-8fe0-06f655205223>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 147

Reference: EXO 28:42
Text: And thou shalt make them linen breeches to cover their nakedness; from the loins even unto the thighs they shall reach:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/28/43
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:827ff353-a141-43a1-9640-6356212eb8c3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 306

Reference: EXO 28:43
Text: And they shall be upon Aaron, and upon his sons, when they come in unto the tabernacle of the congregation, or when they come near unto the altar to minister in the holy place; that they bear not iniquity, and die: it shall be a statute for ever unto him and his seed after him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:63760df9-f32a-41d1-a64b-6035088103e4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 193

Reference: EXO 29:1
Text: And this is the thing that thou shalt do unto them to hallow them, to minister unto me in the priest’s office: Take one young bullock, and two rams without blemish,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e9bbdd93-e5bb-4404-b940-79e5316daa56>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 168

Reference: EXO 29:2
Text: And unleavened bread, and cakes unleavened tempered with oil, and wafers unleavened anointed with oil: of wheaten flour shalt thou make them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ed1003d5-bef7-4a13-8d7a-c10cf42c0196>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 132

Reference: EXO 29:3
Text: And thou shalt put them into one basket, and bring them in the basket, with the bullock and the two rams.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e7b770ec-8bd6-418f-aac1-5e32aa148482>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: EXO 29:4
Text: And Aaron and his sons thou shalt bring unto the door of the tabernacle of the congregation, and shalt wash them with water.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b67ab8a5-33c5-4d58-b8ab-3e19f8c2b4ff>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 203

Reference: EXO 29:5
Text: And thou shalt take the garments, and put upon Aaron the coat, and the robe of the ephod, and the ephod, and the breastplate, and gird him with the curious girdle of the ephod:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2cb58a1f-da23-4fe9-b711-3102103833cb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 109

Reference: EXO 29:6
Text: And thou shalt put the mitre upon his head, and put the holy crown upon the mitre.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d94357ac-86f7-491a-afd9-190a711bb8b7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 109

Reference: EXO 29:7
Text: Then shalt thou take the anointing oil, and pour it upon his head, and anoint him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cf287290-81a1-4393-8038-b2fff495ba2b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 82

Reference: EXO 29:8
Text: And thou shalt bring his sons, and put coats upon them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:06e50384-80ab-4ad0-ba69-e3811b3f4885>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 227

Reference: EXO 29:9
Text: And thou shalt gird them with girdles, Aaron and his sons, and put the bonnets on them: and the priest’s office shall be theirs for a perpetual statute: and thou shalt consecrate Aaron and his sons.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:70aa5f95-3ac1-4ffb-bd82-fcc4653359f3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 190

Reference: EXO 29:10
Text: And thou shalt cause a bullock to be brought before the tabernacle of the congregation: and Aaron and his sons shall put their hands upon the head of the bullock.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:de6ac98c-8c45-4b75-b07e-e36e295af375>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 127

Reference: EXO 29:11
Text: And thou shalt kill the bullock before the LORD, by the door of the tabernacle of the congregation.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:96b64a09-0dbb-4667-919b-b874b1b2d621>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 187

Reference: EXO 29:12
Text: And thou shalt take of the blood of the bullock, and put it upon the horns of the altar with thy finger, and pour all the blood beside the bottom of the altar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:63f46a38-e885-4db0-9886-9f6f5da6512e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 206

Reference: EXO 29:13
Text: And thou shalt take all the fat that covereth the inwards, and the caul that is above the liver, and the two kidneys, and the fat that is upon them, and burn them upon the altar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0c16980a-6144-4a90-b1c3-84b6923e602f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: EXO 29:14
Text: But the flesh of the bullock, and his skin, and his dung, shalt thou burn with fire without the camp: it is a sin offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b739c2f8-3e3d-4a37-badd-d078c6418ceb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 128

Reference: EXO 29:15
Text: Thou shalt also take one ram; and Aaron and his sons shall put their hands upon the head of the ram.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1535c148-9be3-4108-933b-4fbd038cbdf7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 131

Reference: EXO 29:16
Text: And thou shalt slay the ram, and thou shalt take his blood, and sprinkle it round about upon the altar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7fe61d22-3828-47d9-83e6-87f9f2f5c487>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 157

Reference: EXO 29:17
Text: And thou shalt cut the ram in pieces, and wash the inwards of him, and his legs, and put them unto his pieces, and unto his head.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9e533cd8-e04a-45c4-b8fd-1bcf17b51312>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 177

Reference: EXO 29:18
Text: And thou shalt burn the whole ram upon the altar: it is a burnt offering unto the LORD: it is a sweet savour, an offering made by fire unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cdefb1a6-eafa-446e-9e04-c706d09a029a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 133

Reference: EXO 29:19
Text: And thou shalt take the other ram; and Aaron and his sons shall put their hands upon the head of the ram.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d6530017-b0a1-468c-a9fe-11849152cd55>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 313

Reference: EXO 29:20
Text: Then shalt thou kill the ram, and take of his blood, and put it upon the tip of the right ear of Aaron, and upon the tip of the right ear of his sons, and upon the thumb of their right hand, and upon the great toe of their right foot, and sprinkle the blood upon the altar round about.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6bef672f-b665-4bc1-9f40-5217ad9d8c4d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 317

Reference: EXO 29:21
Text: And thou shalt take of the blood that is upon the altar, and of the anointing oil, and sprinkle it upon Aaron, and upon his garments, and upon his sons, and upon the garments of his sons with him: and he shall be hallowed, and his garments, and his sons, and his sons’ garments with him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:10b96ac7-f0c6-45c6-aea8-5ec9a3c82da5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 259

Reference: EXO 29:22
Text: Also thou shalt take of the ram the fat and the rump, and the fat that covereth the inwards, and the caul above the liver, and the two kidneys, and the fat that is upon them, and the right shoulder; for it is a ram of consecration:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0d7ac5be-94f8-4915-b100-d0f8783fb14c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 160

Reference: EXO 29:23
Text: And one loaf of bread, and one cake of oiled bread, and one wafer out of the basket of the unleavened bread that is before the LORD:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3db05dc7-ee71-411a-a7f8-fab699cc1376>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 160

Reference: EXO 29:24
Text: And thou shalt put all in the hands of Aaron, and in the hands of his sons; and shalt wave them for a wave offering before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:46ae3950-3a80-4bd5-8d33-8a786e2a5a66>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 204

Reference: EXO 29:25
Text: And thou shalt receive them of their hands, and burn them upon the altar for a burnt offering, for a sweet savour before the LORD: it is an offering made by fire unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9b6ab41e-8b63-408e-b0dd-a5102b8e1e2b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 171

Reference: EXO 29:26
Text: And thou shalt take the breast of the ram of Aaron’s consecration, and wave it for a wave offering before the LORD: and it shall be thy part.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:57065b5c-33e0-4ac3-94ca-4844d05cc5f3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 264

Reference: EXO 29:27
Text: And thou shalt sanctify the breast of the wave offering, and the shoulder of the heave offering, which is waved, and which is heaved up, of the ram of the consecration, even of that which is for Aaron, and of that which is for his sons:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8843892a-7ea2-4843-b702-753c1b59813c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 295

Reference: EXO 29:28
Text: And it shall be Aaron’s and his sons’ by a statute for ever from the children of Israel: for it is an heave offering: and it shall be an heave offering from the children of Israel of the sacrifice of their peace offerings, even their heave offering unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0a66a5b3-ed27-4089-9e3b-35c48e0536b5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 145

Reference: EXO 29:29
Text: And the holy garments of Aaron shall be his sons’ after him, to be anointed therein, and to be consecrated in them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4f1f8608-72a8-47c5-b43a-143744110ec4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 184

Reference: EXO 29:30
Text: And that son that is priest in his stead shall put them on seven days, when he cometh into the tabernacle of the congregation to minister in the holy place.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:06632b1f-d67e-4eda-8a15-78c1fa790edd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 116

Reference: EXO 29:31
Text: And thou shalt take the ram of the consecration, and seethe his flesh in the holy place.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a2db483c-17e8-4fc8-9c27-98c9b3ca1b2f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 169

Reference: EXO 29:32
Text: And Aaron and his sons shall eat the flesh of the ram, and the bread that is in the basket by the door of the tabernacle of the congregation.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3d2c83ae-212d-4047-be81-39670dfd8741>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 190

Reference: EXO 29:33
Text: And they shall eat those things wherewith the atonement was made, to consecrate and to sanctify them: but a stranger shall not eat thereof, because they are holy.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e383de08-fde3-47fa-ad1a-37f32aa71669>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 206

Reference: EXO 29:34
Text: And if ought of the flesh of the consecrations, or of the bread, remain unto the morning, then thou shalt burn the remainder with fire: it shall not be eaten, because it is holy.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/35
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c48db810-0724-4e94-bab1-ce0ad1d8acb1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 171

Reference: EXO 29:35
Text: And thus shalt thou do unto Aaron, and to his sons, according to all things which I have commanded thee: seven days shalt thou consecrate them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/36
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2fb95728-2839-4a4a-8f66-08429167afee>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 219

Reference: EXO 29:36
Text: And thou shalt offer every day a bullock for a sin offering for atonement: and thou shalt cleanse the altar, when thou hast made an atonement for it, and thou shalt anoint it, to sanctify it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/37
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a2d89d75-8fa5-43b6-a7d1-18e4491e0067>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 180

Reference: EXO 29:37
Text: Seven days thou shalt make an atonement for the altar, and sanctify it; and it shall be an altar most holy: whatsoever toucheth the altar shall be holy.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/38
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:46636fbd-9d8b-48c5-96c7-dc060e8c8bbc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: EXO 29:38
Text: Now this is that which thou shalt offer upon the altar; two lambs of the first year day by day continually.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/39
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:26069413-28dd-43ac-bcc4-0851eafd462b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 118

Reference: EXO 29:39
Text: The one lamb thou shalt offer in the morning; and the other lamb thou shalt offer at even:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/40
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:91bebbcd-4a5e-450a-91c0-1f26465cb358>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 185

Reference: EXO 29:40
Text: And with the one lamb a tenth deal of flour mingled with the fourth part of an hin of beaten oil; and the fourth part of an hin of wine for a drink offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/41
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:364e832c-6f43-4f91-8c6d-0afe759d83fa>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 245

Reference: EXO 29:41
Text: And the other lamb thou shalt offer at even, and shalt do thereto according to the meat offering of the morning, and according to the drink offering thereof, for a sweet savour, an offering made by fire unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/42
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4b82ec23-78a9-481c-be0b-1fc8fe979800>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 212

Reference: EXO 29:42
Text: This shall be a continual burnt offering throughout your generations at the door of the tabernacle of the congregation before the LORD: where I will meet you, to speak there unto thee.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/43
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cb3d1b49-795d-4fea-8bd4-12757ab2943c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 130

Reference: EXO 29:43
Text: And there I will meet with the children of Israel, and the tabernacle shall be sanctified by my glory.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/44
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:fe8f2f54-909e-4d59-8762-08db2fa5e1f4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 188

Reference: EXO 29:44
Text: And I will sanctify the tabernacle of the congregation, and the altar: I will sanctify also both Aaron and his sons, to minister to me in the priest’s office.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/45
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d3811d16-d67f-406f-9402-c2caef4a9937>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 97

Reference: EXO 29:45
Text: And I will dwell among the children of Israel, and will be their God.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/29/46
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:961c5a7b-d4b0-4f2c-bd61-38932dc32056>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 181

Reference: EXO 29:46
Text: And they shall know that I am the LORD their God, that brought them forth out of the land of Egypt, that I may dwell among them: I am the LORD their God.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:48e92404-3deb-4104-8311-fbcdb9f843d2>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 113

Reference: EXO 30:1
Text: And thou shalt make an altar to burn incense upon: of shittim wood shalt thou make it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1ac95c84-8e0b-4472-85a3-346dea33c9d0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 204

Reference: EXO 30:2
Text: A cubit shall be the length thereof, and a cubit the breadth thereof; foursquare shall it be: and two cubits shall be the height thereof: the horns thereof shall be of the same.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b7ea1c37-1910-4c30-b117-0e2c7b45ca38>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 200

Reference: EXO 30:3
Text: And thou shalt overlay it with pure gold, the top thereof, and the sides thereof round about, and the horns thereof; and thou shalt make unto it a crown of gold round about.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7fad17c0-2ca9-42c4-a231-c7fdcda82bf9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 228

Reference: EXO 30:4
Text: And two golden rings shalt thou make to it under the crown of it, by the two corners thereof, upon the two sides of it shalt thou make it; and they shall be for places for the staves to bear it withal.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b1a495ca-3f21-4751-97cf-bc10e0f6a990>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 102

Reference: EXO 30:5
Text: And thou shalt make the staves of shittim wood, and overlay them with gold.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8255f614-ad8b-4ce8-8fbf-b3864459f44d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 180

Reference: EXO 30:6
Text: And thou shalt put it before the vail that is by the ark of the testimony, before the mercy seat that is over the testimony, where I will meet with thee.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:bc960a7b-d74f-4236-ac0a-ca549c14bf9c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 143

Reference: EXO 30:7
Text: And Aaron shall burn thereon sweet incense every morning: when he dresseth the lamps, he shall burn incense upon it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e8d4c74b-885e-49c0-a773-ff21b085bae4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 165

Reference: EXO 30:8
Text: And when Aaron lighteth the lamps at even, he shall burn incense upon it, a perpetual incense before the LORD throughout your generations.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f87a0efa-478a-457b-9b37-a5808f1a9a10>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 155

Reference: EXO 30:9
Text: Ye shall offer no strange incense thereon, nor burnt sacrifice, nor meat offering; neither shall ye pour drink offering thereon.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6a943e61-f367-46ee-92fa-2378bfbf0ab5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 256

Reference: EXO 30:10
Text: And Aaron shall make an atonement upon the horns of it once in a year with the blood of the sin offering of atonements: once in the year shall he make atonement upon it throughout your generations: it is most holy unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d404c454-7568-429d-a469-bc62aabcb4ba>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 66

Reference: EXO 30:11
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:70f1c710-b700-4220-94ac-afde8adff3c3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 254

Reference: EXO 30:12
Text: When thou takest the sum of the children of Israel after their number, then shall they give every man a ransom for his soul unto the LORD, when thou numberest them; that there be no plague among them, when thou numberest them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b162bd74-e30c-45e6-bf35-2027ec0fae3c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 230

Reference: EXO 30:13
Text: This they shall give, every one that passeth among them that are numbered, half a shekel after the shekel of the sanctuary: (a shekel is twenty gerahs:) an half shekel shall be the offering of the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3a9c0479-f14e-4864-98d4-6719919669f3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: EXO 30:14
Text: Every one that passeth among them that are numbered, from twenty years old and above, shall give an offering unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5a7bcfd0-0869-48cc-845f-c85def0fa1bb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 189

Reference: EXO 30:15
Text: The rich shall not give more, and the poor shall not give less than half a shekel, when they give an offering unto the LORD, to make an atonement for your souls.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:38bf58e7-8b6b-46b3-9dcf-e8f4357b7b1b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 278

Reference: EXO 30:16
Text: And thou shalt take the atonement money of the children of Israel, and shalt appoint it for the service of the tabernacle of the congregation; that it may be a memorial unto the children of Israel before the LORD, to make an atonement for your souls.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6857d6f5-c212-450d-b0b5-4a38404c39bf>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 66

Reference: EXO 30:17
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3286026d-9e43-46a1-bb5b-77c56a368d9b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 224

Reference: EXO 30:18
Text: Thou shalt also make a laver of brass, and his foot also of brass, to wash withal: and thou shalt put it between the tabernacle of the congregation and the altar, and thou shalt put water therein.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9ae5e8b6-f52b-48c2-bd08-c94ae1b51d5a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 97

Reference: EXO 30:19
Text: For Aaron and his sons shall wash their hands and their feet thereat:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:67fceec3-01a6-4a14-bd99-2cf40ac77feb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 222

Reference: EXO 30:20
Text: When they go into the tabernacle of the congregation, they shall wash with water, that they die not; or when they come near to the altar to minister, to burn offering made by fire unto the LORD:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4de27f54-c405-4643-b228-f0a588b86459>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 195

Reference: EXO 30:21
Text: So they shall wash their hands and their feet, that they die not: and it shall be a statute for ever to them, even to him and to his seed throughout their generations.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2fc902ab-ff14-4991-a91a-77f6bdd1ddfd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 71

Reference: EXO 30:22
Text: Moreover the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:752fa765-b4fe-4b58-af1c-9a1cbd03df2a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 230

Reference: EXO 30:23
Text: Take thou also unto thee principal spices, of pure myrrh five hundred shekels, and of sweet cinnamon half so much, even two hundred and fifty shekels, and of sweet calamus two hundred and fifty shekels,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f0acf896-9d19-46a3-b607-cac6271b3ed0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 123

Reference: EXO 30:24
Text: And of cassia five hundred shekels, after the shekel of the sanctuary, and of oil olive an hin:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5aafdcd2-bcfd-43e7-8b14-e3482ce0d84b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 164

Reference: EXO 30:25
Text: And thou shalt make it an oil of holy ointment, an ointment compound after the art of the apothecary: it shall be an holy anointing oil.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5f83026b-9d3f-4733-9bde-6e306728ebc0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 125

Reference: EXO 30:26
Text: And thou shalt anoint the tabernacle of the congregation therewith, and the ark of the testimony,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ecdbe9f8-0c1b-4fa2-ae07-a75d9f18a798>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 125

Reference: EXO 30:27
Text: And the table and all his vessels, and the candlestick and his vessels, and the altar of incense,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:84515f38-0dc6-4196-9218-0cc2931d86d2>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 109

Reference: EXO 30:28
Text: And the altar of burnt offering with all his vessels, and the laver and his foot.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6bdb3f44-e494-4b69-a48c-a467a4841011>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 125

Reference: EXO 30:29
Text: And thou shalt sanctify them, that they may be most holy: whatsoever toucheth them shall be holy.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a2f549ba-1ced-47da-8274-2cfc34fc37a2>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 147

Reference: EXO 30:30
Text: And thou shalt anoint Aaron and his sons, and consecrate them, that they may minister unto me in the priest’s office.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7c8e5b0b-820f-4b74-ba39-2fc7a2031ff7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 158

Reference: EXO 30:31
Text: And thou shalt speak unto the children of Israel, saying, This shall be an holy anointing oil unto me throughout your generations.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f9ff2aa6-fcea-41a5-a024-7b539e7bbeac>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 183

Reference: EXO 30:32
Text: Upon man’s flesh shall it not be poured, neither shall ye make any other like it, after the composition of it: it is holy, and it shall be holy unto you.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9afad583-09d9-41c9-9fac-4b5db270942f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 149

Reference: EXO 30:33
Text: Whosoever compoundeth any like it, or whosoever putteth any of it upon a stranger, shall even be cut off from his people.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5264d00a-a455-4527-be2b-e55c3c4b12b8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 201

Reference: EXO 30:34
Text: And the LORD said unto Moses, Take unto thee sweet spices, stacte, and onycha, and galbanum; these sweet spices with pure frankincense: of each shall there be a like weight:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/35
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:afa5266a-dafa-48e5-b766-4295495586e1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 141

Reference: EXO 30:35
Text: And thou shalt make it a perfume, a confection after the art of the apothecary, tempered together, pure and holy:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/36
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2d8cf0ee-e6f9-40d8-9e17-34ed445cbede>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 205

Reference: EXO 30:36
Text: And thou shalt beat some of it very small, and put of it before the testimony in the tabernacle of the congregation, where I will meet with thee: it shall be unto you most holy.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/37
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:dda0ff07-41ad-4684-a9a2-ce55d45d61eb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 184

Reference: EXO 30:37
Text: And as for the perfume which thou shalt make, ye shall not make to yourselves according to the composition thereof: it shall be unto thee holy for the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/30/38
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c1014d31-dc97-4e83-a87c-2cccc4fe4e9d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 121

Reference: EXO 30:38
Text: Whosoever shall make like unto that, to smell thereto, shall even be cut off from his people.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/31/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c7fd452b-fc4f-4f52-b293-6c53bc3f91f8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 65

Reference: EXO 31:1
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/31/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
