Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 173

Reference: EXO 34:26
Text: The first of the firstfruits of thy land thou shalt bring unto the house of the LORD thy God. Thou shalt not seethe a kid in his mother’s milk.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9202975d-964c-41a6-83b3-7d39df43664b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: EXO 34:27
Text: And the LORD said unto Moses, Write thou these words: for after the tenor of these words I have made a covenant with thee and with Israel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6a205f26-97b4-4f4f-b274-df7eff32f195>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 208

Reference: EXO 34:28
Text: And he was there with the LORD forty days and forty nights; he did neither eat bread, nor drink water. And he wrote upon the tables the words of the covenant, the ten commandments.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:de626c06-befe-448f-abcb-cddffd80084b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 249

Reference: EXO 34:29
Text: And it came to pass, when Moses came down from mount Sinai with the two tables of testimony in Moses’ hand, when he came down from the mount, that Moses wist not that the skin of his face shone while he talked with him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:066dcc9a-bba4-4768-831d-cd3d9853bdbf>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 159

Reference: EXO 34:30
Text: And when Aaron and all the children of Israel saw Moses, behold, the skin of his face shone; and they were afraid to come nigh him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e8464c81-7947-439c-a393-c5cfc8a40293>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: EXO 34:31
Text: And Moses called unto them; and Aaron and all the rulers of the congregation returned unto him: and Moses talked with them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:61548d27-2215-4041-80cc-77e6592ad45a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 165

Reference: EXO 34:32
Text: And afterward all the children of Israel came nigh: and he gave them in commandment all that the LORD had spoken with him in mount Sinai.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
