Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 98

Reference: EXO 34:33
Text: And till Moses had done speaking with them, he put a vail on his face.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:671656e8-bc7c-4c6c-8eb7-e84ff37061f3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 210

Reference: EXO 34:34
Text: But when Moses went in before the LORD to speak with him, he took the vail off, until he came out. And he came out, and spake unto the children of Israel that which he was commanded.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/34/35
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
