Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 107

Reference: EXO 36:7
Text: For the stuff they had was sufficient for all the work to make it, and too much.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8a87c0aa-0035-4f10-9b7b-100179dabfe8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 224

Reference: EXO 36:8
Text: And every wise hearted man among them that wrought the work of the tabernacle made ten curtains of fine twined linen, and blue, and purple, and scarlet: with cherubims of cunning work made he them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c601e785-6433-48b8-b2a5-b5fe5209c9d9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 160

Reference: EXO 36:9
Text: The length of one curtain was twenty and eight cubits, and the breadth of one curtain four cubits: the curtains were all of one size.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:215fd5c6-fc1e-4177-9c2b-16998417e670>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: EXO 36:10
Text: And he coupled the five curtains one unto another: and the other five curtains he coupled one unto another.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c969a092-5216-471f-a475-98728db94e4c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 205

Reference: EXO 36:11
Text: And he made loops of blue on the edge of one curtain from the selvedge in the coupling: likewise he made in the uttermost side of another curtain, in the coupling of the second.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9398afbd-df0a-45c6-84f1-c97e43230a1f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 194

Reference: EXO 36:12
Text: Fifty loops made he in one curtain, and fifty loops made he in the edge of the curtain which was in the coupling of the second: the loops held one curtain to another.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d1c6a85f-732c-438b-bfa1-7217c887a56a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 149

Reference: EXO 36:13
Text: And he made fifty taches of gold, and coupled the curtains one unto another with the taches: so it became one tabernacle.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f1bff0b7-eacc-4123-8955-513ae69705c7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: EXO 36:14
Text: And he made curtains of goats’ hair for the tent over the tabernacle: eleven curtains he made them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c8a62826-8237-4707-a052-3aa28e85f385>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 158

Reference: EXO 36:15
Text: The length of one curtain was thirty cubits, and four cubits was the breadth of one curtain: the eleven curtains were of one size.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:86e938b4-edbe-4e3b-a3f6-50c422d9ca9d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 103

Reference: EXO 36:16
Text: And he coupled five curtains by themselves, and six curtains by themselves.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1671a192-4cb4-45c1-9ff9-36d0db8a5384>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 187

Reference: EXO 36:17
Text: And he made fifty loops upon the uttermost edge of the curtain in the coupling, and fifty loops made he upon the edge of the curtain which coupleth the second.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
