Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 137

Reference: EXO 36:19
Text: And he made a covering for the tent of rams’ skins dyed red, and a covering of badgers’ skins above that.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
