Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 114

Reference: EXO 36:21
Text: The length of a board was ten cubits, and the breadth of a board one cubit and a half.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ebaed3e3-c79c-4aef-996a-96b245d2faa1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 142

Reference: EXO 36:22
Text: One board had two tenons, equally distant one from another: thus did he make for all the boards of the tabernacle.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c02fca64-e5af-4018-a989-b789df03b79e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 110

Reference: EXO 36:23
Text: And he made boards for the tabernacle; twenty boards for the south side southward:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
