Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 192

Reference: EXO 36:24
Text: And forty sockets of silver he made under the twenty boards; two sockets under one board for his two tenons, and two sockets under another board for his two tenons.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:02e5de29-942a-4300-af3e-9903e04642a7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 126

Reference: EXO 36:25
Text: And for the other side of the tabernacle, which is toward the north corner, he made twenty boards,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:76885cfa-78d2-4714-b834-e983575061e8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 128

