Text: And their forty sockets of silver; two sockets under one board, and two sockets under another board.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ce1e4b5f-18e0-4d00-9f74-bf7981fbd57e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 92

Reference: EXO 36:27
Text: And for the sides of the tabernacle westward he made six boards.


