WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:df2b0908-a9ea-4b08-bf4a-7bf851cad69a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 102

