Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 164

Reference: EXO 36:32
Text: And five bars for the boards of the other side of the tabernacle, and five bars for the boards of the tabernacle for the sides westward.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/36/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
