Reference: EXO 40:1
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f45d16af-d8ac-4707-8901-206f3a9c4341>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 128

Reference: EXO 40:2
Text: On the first day of the first month shalt thou set up the tabernacle of the tent of the congregation.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1ec2eb4a-2bd6-46b8-8888-56e200de8e09>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 112

Reference: EXO 40:3
Text: And thou shalt put therein the ark of the testimony, and cover the ark with the vail.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8d1b66f6-1471-4f53-a222-008108f735ff>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 196

Reference: EXO 40:4
Text: And thou shalt bring in the table, and set in order the things that are to be set in order upon it; and thou shalt bring in the candlestick, and light the lamps thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f18066b6-df9a-4a08-9314-03c4dd0fe61a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 163

Reference: EXO 40:5
Text: And thou shalt set the altar of gold for the incense before the ark of the testimony, and put the hanging of the door to the tabernacle.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6b6c555e-420e-407b-94d8-4999c4334c25>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 144

Reference: EXO 40:6
Text: And thou shalt set the altar of the burnt offering before the door of the tabernacle of the tent of the congregation.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:28f13915-5c15-4843-804b-606dd6efbea8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 136

