Text: And thou shalt set the laver between the tent of the congregation and the altar, and shalt put water therein.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2bf56b92-a2fa-423b-a414-2322767918b3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 114

Reference: EXO 40:8
Text: And thou shalt set up the court round about, and hang up the hanging at the court gate.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9050fcff-e85b-4d4c-8db9-dbe2b4fcde19>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 189

Reference: EXO 40:9
Text: And thou shalt take the anointing oil, and anoint the tabernacle, and all that is therein, and shalt hallow it, and all the vessels thereof: and it shall be holy.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0ec2bd81-dc1d-4156-a272-7bc210184709>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 163

Reference: EXO 40:10
Text: And thou shalt anoint the altar of the burnt offering, and all his vessels, and sanctify the altar: and it shall be an altar most holy.


