WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EXO/40/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6a6f247c-c207-4de3-8eb6-a262c677daaf>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 149

