Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 194

Reference: LEV 8:25
Text: And he took the fat, and the rump, and all the fat that was upon the inwards, and the caul above the liver, and the two kidneys, and their fat, and the right shoulder:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:066a1c14-b1c0-4790-93e9-6938149d75d4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 220

Reference: LEV 8:26
Text: And out of the basket of unleavened bread, that was before the LORD, he took one unleavened cake, and a cake of oiled bread, and one wafer, and put them on the fat, and upon the right shoulder:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:010f1039-d847-47b1-a181-5aafa0cda1dc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 143

Reference: LEV 8:27
Text: And he put all upon Aaron’s hands, and upon his sons’ hands, and waved them for a wave offering before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1c657816-389f-4a0d-80d2-96243f7b353d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 211

Reference: LEV 8:28
Text: And Moses took them from off their hands, and burnt them on the altar upon the burnt offering: they were consecrations for a sweet savour: it is an offering made by fire unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6d821f1a-b15f-484c-8da4-e65ec69b8c03>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 185

Reference: LEV 8:29
Text: And Moses took the breast, and waved it for a wave offering before the LORD: for of the ram of consecration it was Moses’ part; as the LORD commanded Moses.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:50772bcd-bba0-434c-aac8-3cfa7e298c97>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 306

Reference: LEV 8:30
Text: And Moses took of the anointing oil, and of the blood which was upon the altar, and sprinkled it upon Aaron, and upon his garments, and upon his sons, and upon his sons’ garments with him; and sanctified Aaron, and his garments, and his sons, and his sons’ garments with him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:fa33bf29-d702-4c1b-93e6-81966e20d841>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 264

Reference: LEV 8:31
Text: And Moses said unto Aaron and to his sons, Boil the flesh at the door of the tabernacle of the congregation: and there eat it with the bread that is in the basket of consecrations, as I commanded, saying, Aaron and his sons shall eat it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:41565f72-e3d9-4066-aa0a-aa0d511a89cc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 106

Reference: LEV 8:32
Text: And that which remaineth of the flesh and of the bread shall ye burn with fire.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8f480283-48f2-4f8f-a608-3927b48ab323>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 205

Reference: LEV 8:33
Text: And ye shall not go out of the door of the tabernacle of the congregation in seven days, until the days of your consecration be at an end: for seven days shall he consecrate you.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:887df0ca-e16f-4f25-83d0-75bee4d63b44>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 116

Reference: LEV 8:34
Text: As he hath done this day, so the LORD hath commanded to do, to make an atonement for you.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/35
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4b87a155-fdaf-4d09-9eb2-b3816ec45986>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 200

Reference: LEV 8:35
Text: Therefore shall ye abide at the door of the tabernacle of the congregation day and night seven days, and keep the charge of the LORD, that ye die not: for so I am commanded.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/8/36
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:364b0d09-e7f6-48e8-b55a-b48ad3ec4561>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 110

Reference: LEV 8:36
Text: So Aaron and his sons did all things which the LORD commanded by the hand of Moses.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b4b273ec-bf7f-4025-a663-72e2c4453cd4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 128

Reference: LEV 9:1
Text: And it came to pass on the eighth day, that Moses called Aaron and his sons, and the elders of Israel;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4ee0132c-f30d-4ff5-aac7-9863fe63f891>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 173

Reference: LEV 9:2
Text: And he said unto Aaron, Take thee a young calf for a sin offering, and a ram for a burnt offering, without blemish, and offer them before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4037386c-bbdb-49ea-9212-5f3d7d34f791>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 216

Reference: LEV 9:3
Text: And unto the children of Israel thou shalt speak, saying, Take ye a kid of the goats for a sin offering; and a calf and a lamb, both of the first year, without blemish, for a burnt offering;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4bc83b2d-80fb-453d-a6e5-78e7d3bf2669>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 181

Reference: LEV 9:4
Text: Also a bullock and a ram for peace offerings, to sacrifice before the LORD; and a meat offering mingled with oil: for to day the LORD will appear unto you.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a6e1a992-3c4f-4641-96db-169ae8e538ef>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 174

Reference: LEV 9:5
Text: And they brought that which Moses commanded before the tabernacle of the congregation: and all the congregation drew near and stood before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:17f1c63d-142b-437c-858e-c0076ec25cf9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 152

Reference: LEV 9:6
Text: And Moses said, This is the thing which the LORD commanded that ye should do: and the glory of the LORD shall appear unto you.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6ae6ee17-5c75-447b-9443-d68c15ed4842>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 271

Reference: LEV 9:7
Text: And Moses said unto Aaron, Go unto the altar, and offer thy sin offering, and thy burnt offering, and make an atonement for thyself, and for the people: and offer the offering of the people, and make an atonement for them; as the LORD commanded.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8a3cbe09-f113-4347-b191-e17bb2061fcf>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 124

Reference: LEV 9:8
Text: Aaron therefore went unto the altar, and slew the calf of the sin offering, which was for himself.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d07ee688-38ae-4635-a40e-9f19e327b2d8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 207

Reference: LEV 9:9
Text: And the sons of Aaron brought the blood unto him: and he dipped his finger in the blood, and put it upon the horns of the altar, and poured out the blood at the bottom of the altar:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4730f682-b03d-4767-89df-1ef729f956ea>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 160

Reference: LEV 9:10
Text: But the fat, and the kidneys, and the caul above the liver of the sin offering, he burnt upon the altar; as the LORD commanded Moses.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
