Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 90

Reference: LEV 9:11
Text: And the flesh and the hide he burnt with fire without the camp.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
