WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3a44d20f-82d2-4739-9b1c-8b2763d9f8bd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 102

Reference: LEV 9:20
Text: And they put the fat upon the breasts, and he burnt the fat upon the altar:


