Content-Length: 134

Reference: LEV 9:21
Text: And the breasts and the right shoulder Aaron waved for a wave offering before the LORD; as Moses commanded.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LEV/9/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
