Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 261

Reference: NUM 7:1
Text: And it came to pass on the day that Moses had fully set up the tabernacle, and had anointed it, and sanctified it, and all the instruments thereof, both the altar and all the vessels thereof, and had anointed them, and sanctified them;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:35eeda11-90dc-4f05-a091-5ea154edc1cd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 174

Reference: NUM 7:2
Text: That the princes of Israel, heads of the house of their fathers, who were the princes of the tribes, and were over them that were numbered, offered:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:bedf0e4c-2020-4c2f-9ac9-0be6b64ba109>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 212

Reference: NUM 7:3
Text: And they brought their offering before the LORD, six covered wagons, and twelve oxen; a wagon for two of the princes, and for each one an ox: and they brought them before the tabernacle.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a870f55d-9cbe-4d04-af5f-753afea2e86c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 64

Reference: NUM 7:4
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3a3668fe-cd3c-43da-8bdd-d8cde9f36d4d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 198

Reference: NUM 7:5
Text: Take it of them, that they may be to do the service of the tabernacle of the congregation; and thou shalt give them unto the Levites, to every man according to his service.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:bad8eb75-7d9f-48cc-9144-d4c349261fda>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 97

Reference: NUM 7:6
Text: And Moses took the wagons and the oxen, and gave them unto the Levites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d1c21b35-72ca-4b3d-80cf-b7a9f7bb2690>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 112

Reference: NUM 7:7
Text: Two wagons and four oxen he gave unto the sons of Gershon, according to their service:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9ba5dc04-2541-4cd1-99dc-9c39100a1f32>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 174

Reference: NUM 7:8
Text: And four wagons and eight oxen he gave unto the sons of Merari, according unto their service, under the hand of Ithamar the son of Aaron the priest.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a20c914b-2fde-4a95-9e0c-8b6dba95bdfd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 172

Reference: NUM 7:9
Text: But unto the sons of Kohath he gave none: because the service of the sanctuary belonging unto them was that they should bear upon their shoulders.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e78c1540-58a7-4a95-938a-4c31c10263f6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 169

Reference: NUM 7:10
Text: And the princes offered for dedicating of the altar in the day that it was anointed, even the princes offered their offering before the altar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/7/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
