Text: Of the sons of Zebulun after their families: of Sered, the family of the Sardites: of Elon, the family of the Elonites: of Jahleel, the family of the Jahleelites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
