Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 154

Reference: NUM 26:27
Text: These are the families of the Zebulunites according to those that were numbered of them, threescore thousand and five hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:424476b3-d060-4837-b691-e0beb892146a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 94

Reference: NUM 26:28
Text: The sons of Joseph after their families were Manasseh and Ephraim.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:56a25a5a-00d1-47ac-919a-9861b4e43869>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 163

