WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0aa42b7b-26f9-4263-a479-a3e689a89a26>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 119

Reference: NUM 26:32
Text: And of Shemida, the family of the Shemidaites: and of Hepher, the family of the Hepherites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e1a39d9d-e8a0-43c3-badf-e3c217d85096>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 184

Reference: NUM 26:33
Text: And Zelophehad the son of Hepher had no sons, but daughters: and the names of the daughters of Zelophehad were Mahlah, and Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a8d7abd8-788f-4bca-a1a8-1d0684fd0f1d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 143

Reference: NUM 26:34
Text: These are the families of Manasseh, and those that were numbered of them, fifty and two thousand and seven hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/35
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1cc7346e-e8a1-4ddc-88fb-7cce731450d2>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 204

Reference: NUM 26:35
Text: These are the sons of Ephraim after their families: of Shuthelah, the family of the Shuthalhites: of Becher, the family of the Bachrites: of Tahan, the family of the Tahanites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/36
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:49709ae9-83d7-4882-b88f-5c7e8e321812>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 101

Reference: NUM 26:36
Text: And these are the sons of Shuthelah: of Eran, the family of the Eranites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/37
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:64b8a8ad-3ace-43ff-853f-6dd6d77815da>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 213

Reference: NUM 26:37
Text: These are the families of the sons of Ephraim according to those that were numbered of them, thirty and two thousand and five hundred. These are the sons of Joseph after their families.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/38
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:935e95f5-76db-4bb7-8eec-38c87142ea48>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 189

Reference: NUM 26:38
Text: The sons of Benjamin after their families: of Bela, the family of the Belaites: of Ashbel, the family of the Ashbelites: of Ahiram, the family of the Ahiramites:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/39
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0d3e2cc5-674d-4a30-b48a-7278005288f9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 111

Reference: NUM 26:39
Text: Of Shupham, the family of the Shuphamites: of Hupham, the family of the Huphamites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/40
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7d3fe101-a577-4e31-8d56-77478f2c2340>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 147

Reference: NUM 26:40
Text: And the sons of Bela were Ard and Naaman: of Ard, the family of the Ardites: and of Naaman, the family of the Naamites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/41
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b9c439ee-da9d-4721-93c7-e2c47fc713ed>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 162

Reference: NUM 26:41
Text: These are the sons of Benjamin after their families: and they that were numbered of them were forty and five thousand and six hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/42
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f8bbdd68-a3c1-49ff-ae6e-b41f050f0fe4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 168

Reference: NUM 26:42
Text: These are the sons of Dan after their families: of Shuham, the family of the Shuhamites. These are the families of Dan after their families.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/43
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:631fd048-0dbd-4fe2-a4c9-ea5e7fe00d8b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 162

Reference: NUM 26:43
Text: All the families of the Shuhamites, according to those that were numbered of them, were threescore and four thousand and four hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/44
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:069f4466-f38f-474b-a628-27d28c75555b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 189

Reference: NUM 26:44
Text: Of the children of Asher after their families: of Jimna, the family of the Jimnites: of Jesui, the family of the Jesuites: of Beriah, the family of the Beriites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/45
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6b4babfd-e28b-4a00-98e0-469e0fdf3588>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 134

Reference: NUM 26:45
Text: Of the sons of Beriah: of Heber, the family of the Heberites: of Malchiel, the family of the Malchielites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/46
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4ef01385-6ef7-4e23-bb90-87587f23f29d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 76

Reference: NUM 26:46
Text: And the name of the daughter of Asher was Sarah.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/47
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8c134d2a-43f6-43f2-b588-465b2ed141b6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 170

Reference: NUM 26:47
Text: These are the families of the sons of Asher according to those that were numbered of them; who were fifty and three thousand and four hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/48
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d9cae6dd-544f-40b2-8b59-a36a0e8fabad>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 152

Reference: NUM 26:48
Text: Of the sons of Naphtali after their families: of Jahzeel, the family of the Jahzeelites: of Guni, the family of the Gunites:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/49
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1370c9c2-0447-4ce5-98d5-940ee62e61b5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 109

Reference: NUM 26:49
Text: Of Jezer, the family of the Jezerites: of Shillem, the family of the Shillemites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/50
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5aa1b41a-c3ba-4f06-8035-0c01164ca397>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 174

Reference: NUM 26:50
Text: These are the families of Naphtali according to their families: and they that were numbered of them were forty and five thousand and four hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/51
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:33e266d7-fd0c-4c32-a3b4-f5249f3e4a92>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 140

Reference: NUM 26:51
Text: These were the numbered of the children of Israel, six hundred thousand and a thousand seven hundred and thirty.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/52
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a573d9a5-bc5a-41bb-b5a4-1af950b58f94>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 66

Reference: NUM 26:52
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/53
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4a8aef49-c8ed-4be1-bc95-8280375b0aef>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 117

Reference: NUM 26:53
Text: Unto these the land shall be divided for an inheritance according to the number of names.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/54
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2dc7b81b-17d3-43fa-a974-ff202ccf60f0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 212

Reference: NUM 26:54
Text: To many thou shalt give the more inheritance, and to few thou shalt give the less inheritance: to every one shall his inheritance be given according to those that were numbered of him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/55
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cc592abb-f86c-4026-9012-cbccff71235a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: NUM 26:55
Text: Notwithstanding the land shall be divided by lot: according to the names of the tribes of their fathers they shall inherit.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/56
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:fe96d00a-c363-4022-8a0f-f6dfbfce3d65>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 110

Reference: NUM 26:56
Text: According to the lot shall the possession thereof be divided between many and few.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/57
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0907a120-34c1-4e82-9dbd-28e7902bb948>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 226

Reference: NUM 26:57
Text: And these are they that were numbered of the Levites after their families: of Gershon, the family of the Gershonites: of Kohath, the family of the Kohathites: of Merari, the family of the Merarites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/58
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c6fc4baf-e689-4644-8fe5-f53014a63965>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 234

Reference: NUM 26:58
Text: These are the families of the Levites: the family of the Libnites, the family of the Hebronites, the family of the Mahlites, the family of the Mushites, the family of the Korathites. And Kohath begat Amram.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/59
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:88dd484d-d8e6-4409-b803-8620da1fe6c7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 199

Reference: NUM 26:59
Text: And the name of Amram’s wife was Jochebed, the daughter of Levi, whom her mother bare to Levi in Egypt: and she bare unto Amram Aaron and Moses, and Miriam their sister.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/60
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:89897f18-91e3-4c7a-a0b2-6490711c69e5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 91

Reference: NUM 26:60
Text: And unto Aaron was born Nadab, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/61
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:13428e9e-2256-43c5-a1b9-212304ccfced>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 101

Reference: NUM 26:61
Text: And Nadab and Abihu died, when they offered strange fire before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/62
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2a1fefdd-be3e-4b1b-a8f4-3a7f5e4f46ba>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 266

Reference: NUM 26:62
Text: And those that were numbered of them were twenty and three thousand, all males from a month old and upward: for they were not numbered among the children of Israel, because there was no inheritance given them among the children of Israel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/63
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8d425677-4859-4257-ac87-b81fa252adc4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 176

Reference: NUM 26:63
Text: These are they that were numbered by Moses and Eleazar the priest, who numbered the children of Israel in the plains of Moab by Jordan near Jericho.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/64
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:fccce458-0501-445e-a16b-cd298456fe15>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 183

Reference: NUM 26:64
Text: But among these there was not a man of them whom Moses and Aaron the priest numbered, when they numbered the children of Israel in the wilderness of Sinai.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/26/65
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:18ef3fb8-baa7-42b6-a073-2d8d2bd9bdea>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 197

Reference: NUM 26:65
Text: For the LORD had said of them, They shall surely die in the wilderness. And there was not left a man of them, save Caleb the son of Jephunneh, and Joshua the son of Nun.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1e006aa3-674f-42fc-8187-f3e79c3b4bc3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 282

Reference: NUM 27:1
Text: Then came the daughters of Zelophehad, the son of Hepher, the son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh, of the families of Manasseh the son of Joseph: and these are the names of his daughters; Mahlah, Noah, and Hoglah, and Milcah, and Tirzah.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:895dd58c-5d2e-4202-ade5-2d9f95f32367>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 194

Reference: NUM 27:2
Text: And they stood before Moses, and before Eleazar the priest, and before the princes and all the congregation, by the door of the tabernacle of the congregation, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7bb4b3e3-f19c-47f0-bea4-0d61c7987aca>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 217

Reference: NUM 27:3
Text: Our father died in the wilderness, and he was not in the company of them that gathered themselves together against the LORD in the company of Korah; but died in his own sin, and had no sons.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6b125aae-069b-4515-af4d-3da984dfa1fa>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 190

Reference: NUM 27:4
Text: Why should the name of our father be done away from among his family, because he hath no son? Give unto us therefore a possession among the brethren of our father.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:df8c41de-9fd2-4a0e-9286-1d0bf4364fa2>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 73

Reference: NUM 27:5
Text: And Moses brought their cause before the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4cf13042-3d6b-47d7-add4-ab838e480dc8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 65

Reference: NUM 27:6
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8e6a1a56-0cd0-428c-be62-dcba0aa4e248>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 231

Reference: NUM 27:7
Text: The daughters of Zelophehad speak right: thou shalt surely give them a possession of an inheritance among their father’s brethren; and thou shalt cause the inheritance of their father to pass unto them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8e18e79a-0e16-47cc-b4af-02f333798a3c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 178

Reference: NUM 27:8
Text: And thou shalt speak unto the children of Israel, saying, If a man die, and have no son, then ye shall cause his inheritance to pass unto his daughter.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:87433f29-5fb1-4b59-9543-d6b103e2b16e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 108

Reference: NUM 27:9
Text: And if he have no daughter, then ye shall give his inheritance unto his brethren.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b86ac0b7-dc77-40f5-a8e3-d77a742e6c4c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 120

Reference: NUM 27:10
Text: And if he have no brethren, then ye shall give his inheritance unto his father’s brethren.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ed593c51-668d-4193-9cbc-7feea6398e6b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 271

Reference: NUM 27:11
Text: And if his father have no brethren, then ye shall give his inheritance unto his kinsman that is next to him of his family, and he shall possess it: and it shall be unto the children of Israel a statute of judgment, as the LORD commanded Moses.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:563b16fc-e740-4c7b-83c5-543dd553bbf4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 158

Reference: NUM 27:12
Text: And the LORD said unto Moses, Get thee up into this mount Abarim, and see the land which I have given unto the children of Israel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a03fb163-cacf-4c18-9355-d0c6ed553460>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: NUM 27:13
Text: And when thou hast seen it, thou also shalt be gathered unto thy people, as Aaron thy brother was gathered.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3f197f3e-2512-4499-bbc8-652431c2ffae>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 235

Reference: NUM 27:14
Text: For ye rebelled against my commandment in the desert of Zin, in the strife of the congregation, to sanctify me at the water before their eyes: that is the water of Meribah in Kadesh in the wilderness of Zin.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c1f318b1-294d-434a-af3d-1d193b9c2811>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 66

Reference: NUM 27:15
Text: And Moses spake unto the LORD, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c3c6fb05-5b99-400e-8670-a91cca066e86>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 111

Reference: NUM 27:16
Text: Let the LORD, the God of the spirits of all flesh, set a man over the congregation,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4dd6df4c-102e-4906-8ac3-46abf7b608d7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 222

Reference: NUM 27:17
Text: Which may go out before them, and which may go in before them, and which may lead them out, and which may bring them in; that the congregation of the LORD be not as sheep which have no shepherd.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cb00dffe-5819-42eb-8d5f-4a178e430513>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 148

Reference: NUM 27:18
Text: And the LORD said unto Moses, Take thee Joshua the son of Nun, a man in whom is the spirit, and lay thine hand upon him;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
