Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 137

Reference: NUM 27:19
Text: And set him before Eleazar the priest, and before all the congregation; and give him a charge in their sight.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c673828b-cd3f-4a3d-a64e-f1d6a170e6ed>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 146

Reference: NUM 27:20
Text: And thou shalt put some of thine honour upon him, that all the congregation of the children of Israel may be obedient.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:51c19830-b7ad-44bc-9758-c62b576dabd8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 291

Reference: NUM 27:21
Text: And he shall stand before Eleazar the priest, who shall ask counsel for him after the judgment of Urim before the LORD: at his word shall they go out, and at his word they shall come in, both he, and all the children of Israel with him, even all the congregation.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:953920c6-0c84-4186-9376-026f055c10db>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 160

Reference: NUM 27:22
Text: And Moses did as the LORD commanded him: and he took Joshua, and set him before Eleazar the priest, and before all the congregation:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/27/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3de37787-0d0d-42f9-82c7-66cb30861cb1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 126

Reference: NUM 27:23
Text: And he laid his hands upon him, and gave him a charge, as the LORD commanded by the hand of Moses.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a6a53c80-a3af-427f-97b5-4075d26e9dd0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 65

Reference: NUM 28:1
Text: And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8f5f6a98-0343-4b71-8cc9-bf8cc45feda9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 218

Reference: NUM 28:2
Text: Command the children of Israel, and say unto them, My offering, and my bread for my sacrifices made by fire, for a sweet savour unto me, shall ye observe to offer unto me in their due season.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:16543939-856c-4448-b545-c5edfaaab184>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 211

Reference: NUM 28:3
Text: And thou shalt say unto them, This is the offering made by fire which ye shall offer unto the LORD; two lambs of the first year without spot day by day, for a continual burnt offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e2345286-8b2a-4cc7-9cf1-b460bbb4321d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 117

Reference: NUM 28:4
Text: The one lamb shalt thou offer in the morning, and the other lamb shalt thou offer at even;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:05041575-3455-4009-9bd1-d2f014f55b7e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: NUM 28:5
Text: And a tenth part of an ephah of flour for a meat offering, mingled with the fourth part of an hin of beaten oil.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:18990061-66b3-487e-9d3a-3580f739a54c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 154

Reference: NUM 28:6
Text: It is a continual burnt offering, which was ordained in mount Sinai for a sweet savour, a sacrifice made by fire unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f170ac61-de50-4220-93f2-881f5ee70c24>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 210

Reference: NUM 28:7
Text: And the drink offering thereof shall be the fourth part of an hin for the one lamb: in the holy place shalt thou cause the strong wine to be poured unto the LORD for a drink offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:92bf5341-6413-4dc2-9925-1c15e794242c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 223

Reference: NUM 28:8
Text: And the other lamb shalt thou offer at even: as the meat offering of the morning, and as the drink offering thereof, thou shalt offer it, a sacrifice made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ea341ab6-2fe1-4fb5-90c9-d268522d01dc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 191

Reference: NUM 28:9
Text: And on the sabbath day two lambs of the first year without spot, and two tenth deals of flour for a meat offering, mingled with oil, and the drink offering thereof:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6868767a-44ac-4489-8dc1-c6bde24ea0e2>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 133

Reference: NUM 28:10
Text: This is the burnt offering of every sabbath, beside the continual burnt offering, and his drink offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:02a035d9-3fad-410b-82fb-5463202d4e8e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 188

Reference: NUM 28:11
Text: And in the beginnings of your months ye shall offer a burnt offering unto the LORD; two young bullocks, and one ram, seven lambs of the first year without spot;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:79008540-61b7-42b7-8cb4-123d8c3438fa>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 195

Reference: NUM 28:12
Text: And three tenth deals of flour for a meat offering, mingled with oil, for one bullock; and two tenth deals of flour for a meat offering, mingled with oil, for one ram;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c2cf95d3-ce5a-4c5b-ba69-a3b5ae1aaad4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 193

Reference: NUM 28:13
Text: And a several tenth deal of flour mingled with oil for a meat offering unto one lamb; for a burnt offering of a sweet savour, a sacrifice made by fire unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f19f15ab-982c-4965-8dda-3f99cc0a3642>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 257

Reference: NUM 28:14
Text: And their drink offerings shall be half an hin of wine unto a bullock, and the third part of an hin unto a ram, and a fourth part of an hin unto a lamb: this is the burnt offering of every month throughout the months of the year.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:88a29bd6-97cf-467a-a879-0eb90667d752>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 164

Reference: NUM 28:15
Text: And one kid of the goats for a sin offering unto the LORD shall be offered, beside the continual burnt offering, and his drink offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:30b7d101-6800-4374-8664-5fa1ce41f2e3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 101

Reference: NUM 28:16
Text: And in the fourteenth day of the first month is the passover of the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:59d4d338-f7b9-47ac-940e-1db05e7e0c87>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 124

Reference: NUM 28:17
Text: And in the fifteenth day of this month is the feast: seven days shall unleavened bread be eaten.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9407fe2f-ba9d-44f7-83a8-dff3c38dbecb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 121

Reference: NUM 28:18
Text: In the first day shall be an holy convocation; ye shall do no manner of servile work therein:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f898a616-13e3-4436-a2aa-89a697787c8e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 215

Reference: NUM 28:19
Text: But ye shall offer a sacrifice made by fire for a burnt offering unto the LORD; two young bullocks, and one ram, and seven lambs of the first year: they shall be unto you without blemish:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3b388e43-e070-4792-8545-0a0435051392>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: NUM 28:20
Text: And their meat offering shall be of flour mingled with oil: three tenth deals shall ye offer for a bullock, and two tenth deals for a ram;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:71735f84-74cb-4879-8d9c-9bd47b8f8fc6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 109

Reference: NUM 28:21
Text: A several tenth deal shalt thou offer for every lamb, throughout the seven lambs:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3adfc1ee-1bdc-4e71-bfde-044a23b7a2b8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 90

Reference: NUM 28:22
Text: And one goat for a sin offering, to make an atonement for you.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b083f4b1-577b-446f-913f-d936281a0383>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 131

Reference: NUM 28:23
Text: Ye shall offer these beside the burnt offering in the morning, which is for a continual burnt offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ed03a90b-25cf-4ddc-a51b-6ac7afe7a1cb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 248

Reference: NUM 28:24
Text: After this manner ye shall offer daily, throughout the seven days, the meat of the sacrifice made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the LORD: it shall be offered beside the continual burnt offering, and his drink offering.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0b7da7aa-8068-4aa8-b9fb-cd5e689c5a32>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 114

Reference: NUM 28:25
Text: And on the seventh day ye shall have an holy convocation; ye shall do no servile work.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5bf97765-a3f9-416c-ac49-33e38c696924>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 201

Reference: NUM 28:26
Text: Also in the day of the firstfruits, when ye bring a new meat offering unto the LORD, after your weeks be out, ye shall have an holy convocation; ye shall do no servile work:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3b2feb7b-5774-452d-acbb-5b0ab3aa8242>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 159

Reference: NUM 28:27
Text: But ye shall offer the burnt offering for a sweet savour unto the LORD; two young bullocks, one ram, seven lambs of the first year;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
