Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 144

Reference: NUM 28:28
Text: And their meat offering of flour mingled with oil, three tenth deals unto one bullock, two tenth deals unto one ram,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/28/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
