Content-Length: 130

Reference: NUM 29:32
Text: And on the seventh day seven bullocks, two rams, and fourteen lambs of the first year without blemish:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/29/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
