Content-Length: 182

Reference: NUM 29:33
Text: And their meat offering and their drink offerings for the bullocks, for the rams, and for the lambs, shall be according to their number, after the manner:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/29/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:fdc3579d-f848-42bd-a484-5815801d2c5b>
