Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 116

Reference: NUM 33:36
Text: And they removed from Eziongaber, and pitched in the wilderness of Zin, which is Kadesh.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NUM/33/37
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
