Reference: DEU 27:2
Text: And it shall be on the day when ye shall pass over Jordan unto the land which the LORD thy God giveth thee, that thou shalt set thee up great stones, and plaister them with plaister:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:94e28c9d-2701-4150-8ed8-c13e72461477>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 276

Reference: DEU 27:3
Text: And thou shalt write upon them all the words of this law, when thou art passed over, that thou mayest go in unto the land which the LORD thy God giveth thee, a land that floweth with milk and honey; as the LORD God of thy fathers hath promised thee.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f437b463-9aa3-449e-b180-9f634511b0ad>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 201

Reference: DEU 27:4
Text: Therefore it shall be when ye be gone over Jordan, that ye shall set up these stones, which I command you this day, in mount Ebal, and thou shalt plaister them with plaister.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5ad60c95-e747-4068-9d15-bc86c4edc1b4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 153

Reference: DEU 27:5
Text: And there shalt thou build an altar unto the LORD thy God, an altar of stones: thou shalt not lift up any iron tool upon them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:237b5dce-76e5-4f13-bb7b-4c5f53291471>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 158

Reference: DEU 27:6
Text: Thou shalt build the altar of the LORD thy God of whole stones: and thou shalt offer burnt offerings thereon unto the LORD thy God:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1b391d8b-d0fd-463a-82bf-b9b9165610b9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 122

Reference: DEU 27:7
Text: And thou shalt offer peace offerings, and shalt eat there, and rejoice before the LORD thy God.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:84ea8987-c8cd-4226-8ddc-1c82dc6c9bc7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 103

Reference: DEU 27:8
Text: And thou shalt write upon the stones all the words of this law very plainly.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ed81ced6-e8dc-4d7d-9620-e22bd0c4fc08>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 186

Reference: DEU 27:9
Text: And Moses and the priests the Levites spake unto all Israel, saying, Take heed, and hearken, O Israel; this day thou art become the people of the LORD thy God.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:152a9da2-9157-4c27-9e11-ee8860e886d1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 157

Reference: DEU 27:10
Text: Thou shalt therefore obey the voice of the LORD thy God, and do his commandments and his statutes, which I command thee this day.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d948c90a-4c0a-406c-99b7-0d1f904eeee6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 78

Reference: DEU 27:11
Text: And Moses charged the people the same day, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/27/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
