Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 116

Reference: DEU 34:3
Text: And the south, and the plain of the valley of Jericho, the city of palm trees, unto Zoar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/34/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c14e9706-5a2d-4d91-ba9c-d65f0982813c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 247

Reference: DEU 34:4
Text: And the LORD said unto him, This is the land which I sware unto Abraham, unto Isaac, and unto Jacob, saying, I will give it unto thy seed: I have caused thee to see it with thine eyes, but thou shalt not go over thither.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/DEU/34/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
