Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 122

Reference: JOS 15:2
Text: And their south border was from the shore of the salt sea, from the bay that looketh southward:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOS/15/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
