Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 126

Reference: JOS 15:15
Text: And he went up thence to the inhabitants of Debir: and the name of Debir before was Kirjathsepher.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOS/15/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
