Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 136

Reference: JOS 15:16
Text: And Caleb said, He that smiteth Kirjathsepher, and taketh it, to him will I give Achsah my daughter to wife.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOS/15/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
