Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 133

Reference: JOS 15:17
Text: And Othniel the son of Kenaz, the brother of Caleb, took it: and he gave him Achsah his daughter to wife.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOS/15/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
