Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 132

Reference: 1SA 30:30
Text: And to them which were in Hormah, and to them which were in Chorashan, and to them which were in Athach,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1SA/30/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
