Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: 1KI 4:20
Text: Judah and Israel were many, as the sand which is by the sea in multitude, eating and drinking, and making merry.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1KI/4/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
