Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: 1CH 4:38
Text: These mentioned by their names were princes in their families: and the house of their fathers increased greatly.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/4/39
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d949a65c-b743-44f2-97a6-8542ebb19bb4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 139

Reference: 1CH 4:39
Text: And they went to the entrance of Gedor, even unto the east side of the valley, to seek pasture for their flocks.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/4/40
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b6bb50b2-93c3-4c6e-94af-9d547ccb16b6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 152

Reference: 1CH 4:40
Text: And they found fat pasture and good, and the land was wide, and quiet, and peaceable; for they of Ham had dwelt there of old.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/4/41
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d47cfa11-f0c5-48a7-a9e2-25cd504ca82c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 280

Reference: 1CH 4:41
Text: And these written by name came in the days of Hezekiah king of Judah, and smote their tents, and the habitations that were found there, and destroyed them utterly unto this day, and dwelt in their rooms: because there was pasture there for their flocks.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/4/42
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ff3ee9b4-b979-4fec-ad18-3a620d111fda>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 203

Reference: 1CH 4:42
Text: And some of them, even of the sons of Simeon, five hundred men, went to mount Seir, having for their captains Pelatiah, and Neariah, and Rephaiah, and Uzziel, the sons of Ishi.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/4/43
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:909881b5-b3f6-4487-8825-87248843b8b6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 118

Reference: 1CH 4:43
Text: And they smote the rest of the Amalekites that were escaped, and dwelt there unto this day.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
