Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 134

Reference: 1CH 5:2
Text: For Judah prevailed above his brethren, and of him came the chief ruler; but the birthright was Joseph’s:)


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3d12dec4-5aee-478f-96a5-9cbd11fecfd6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 120

Reference: 1CH 5:3
Text: The sons, I say, of Reuben the firstborn of Israel were, Hanoch, and Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi.


