Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 153

Reference: 1CH 5:7
Text: And his brethren by their families, when the genealogy of their generations was reckoned, were the chief, Jeiel, and Zechariah,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
