Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: 1CH 5:8
Text: And Bela the son of Azaz, the son of Shema, the son of Joel, who dwelt in Aroer, even unto Nebo and Baalmeon:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5b5277fd-d82b-4f8a-a79e-a62e4a0b86bc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 176

Reference: 1CH 5:9
Text: And eastward he inhabited unto the entering in of the wilderness from the river Euphrates: because their cattle were multiplied in the land of Gilead.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:18fbe42c-f976-433a-96f6-4d3d4bd76328>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 178

Reference: 1CH 5:10
Text: And in the days of Saul they made war with the Hagarites, who fell by their hand: and they dwelt in their tents throughout all the east land of Gilead.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
