Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 110

Reference: 1CH 5:11
Text: And the children of Gad dwelt over against them, in the land of Bashan unto Salcah:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
