Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 99

Reference: 1CH 5:12
Text: Joel the chief, and Shapham the next, and Jaanai, and Shaphat in Bashan.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
