Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: 1CH 5:13
Text: And their brethren of the house of their fathers were, Michael, and Meshullam, and Sheba, and Jorai, and Jachan, and Zia, and Heber, seven.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:17131aa9-ccdb-45f1-bf3d-2d7c5c4d3657>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 191

Reference: 1CH 5:14
Text: These are the children of Abihail the son of Huri, the son of Jaroah, the son of Gilead, the son of Michael, the son of Jeshishai, the son of Jahdo, the son of Buz;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
