Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 103

Reference: 1CH 5:15
Text: Ahi the son of Abdiel, the son of Guni, chief of the house of their fathers.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
