Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 134

Reference: 1CH 5:16
Text: And they dwelt in Gilead in Bashan, and in her towns, and in all the suburbs of Sharon, upon their borders.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
