Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 146

Reference: 1CH 5:17
Text: All these were reckoned by genealogies in the days of Jotham king of Judah, and in the days of Jeroboam king of Israel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:20860994-846e-4865-836f-ef6ae2d5920d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 275

Reference: 1CH 5:18
Text: The sons of Reuben, and the Gadites, and half the tribe of Manasseh, of valiant men, men able to bear buckler and sword, and to shoot with bow, and skilful in war, were four and forty thousand seven hundred and threescore, that went out to the war.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:137ad453-774e-4a02-8273-804fb6d53588>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 100

Reference: 1CH 5:19
Text: And they made war with the Hagarites, with Jetur, and Nephish, and Nodab.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a977609b-3554-4e6b-8be2-537c8dc5413b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 244

Reference: 1CH 5:20
Text: And they were helped against them, and the Hagarites were delivered into their hand, and all that were with them: for they cried to God in the battle, and he was intreated of them; because they put their trust in him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:77d2b1fd-643d-4b8a-8157-6ce4b4812fdc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 195

Reference: 1CH 5:21
Text: And they took away their cattle; of their camels fifty thousand, and of sheep two hundred and fifty thousand, and of asses two thousand, and of men an hundred thousand.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5c719329-d18a-4588-9b0a-e2a42d84b874>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 138

Reference: 1CH 5:22
Text: For there fell down many slain, because the war was of God. And they dwelt in their steads until the captivity.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c7572cf3-1dde-4fb1-a9d9-bde75663a9dc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 169

Reference: 1CH 5:23
Text: And the children of the half tribe of Manasseh dwelt in the land: they increased from Bashan unto Baalhermon and Senir, and unto mount Hermon.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2f204126-22c5-4132-a9c9-47c392677db1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 243

Reference: 1CH 5:24
Text: And these were the heads of the house of their fathers, even Epher, and Ishi, and Eliel, and Azriel, and Jeremiah, and Hodaviah, and Jahdiel, mighty men of valour, famous men, and heads of the house of their fathers.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:af185bde-4019-4c32-bb49-b69baf348e1f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 175

Reference: 1CH 5:25
Text: And they transgressed against the God of their fathers, and went a whoring after the gods of the people of the land, whom God destroyed before them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/5/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:478f3947-03a7-4b80-90ee-ae8c8f4a4f7d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 330

Reference: 1CH 5:26
Text: And the God of Israel stirred up the spirit of Pul king of Assyria, and the spirit of Tilgathpilneser king of Assyria, and he carried them away, even the Reubenites, and the Gadites, and the half tribe of Manasseh, and brought them unto Halah, and Habor, and Hara, and to the river Gozan, unto this day.


