Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 97

Reference: 1CH 23:8
Text: The sons of Laadan; the chief was Jehiel, and Zetham, and Joel, three.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
