Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 134

Reference: 1CH 23:9
Text: The sons of Shimei; Shelomith, and Haziel, and Haran, three. These were the chief of the fathers of Laadan.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
