Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: 1CH 23:10
Text: And the sons of Shimei were, Jahath, Zina, and Jeush, and Beriah. These four were the sons of Shimei.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:90342239-3570-4636-9494-324b567fe05c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 190

Reference: 1CH 23:11
Text: And Jahath was the chief, and Zizah the second: but Jeush and Beriah had not many sons; therefore they were in one reckoning, according to their father’s house.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b6336ba4-d3c8-43e2-b657-e6f2bf94f254>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 87

Reference: 1CH 23:12
Text: The sons of Kohath; Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel, four.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:42f192ae-0fbd-431b-910e-4a034310a8a0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 250

Reference: 1CH 23:13
Text: The sons of Amram; Aaron and Moses: and Aaron was separated, that he should sanctify the most holy things, he and his sons for ever, to burn incense before the LORD, to minister unto him, and to bless in his name for ever.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
