Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 106

Reference: 1CH 23:14
Text: Now concerning Moses the man of God, his sons were named of the tribe of Levi.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
