Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 277

Reference: 1CH 23:24
Text: These were the sons of Levi after the house of their fathers; even the chief of the fathers, as they were counted by number of names by their polls, that did the work for the service of the house of the LORD, from the age of twenty years and upward.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:64ae8ef2-2b8a-474f-9d42-f890a668eed0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 142

Reference: 1CH 23:25
Text: For David said, The LORD God of Israel hath given rest unto his people, that they may dwell in Jerusalem for ever:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ca7dfc9c-a15e-481c-883f-19a929bc355b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 142

Reference: 1CH 23:26
Text: And also unto the Levites; they shall no more carry the tabernacle, nor any vessels of it for the service thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:34fda026-7097-4494-84c7-cd12496f8784>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 117

Reference: 1CH 23:27
Text: For by the last words of David the Levites were numbered from twenty years old and above:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:77271b6d-05c4-4694-8317-f0ad58e4782d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 249

Reference: 1CH 23:28
Text: Because their office was to wait on the sons of Aaron for the service of the house of the LORD, in the courts, and in the chambers, and in the purifying of all holy things, and the work of the service of the house of God;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/29
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:96bbb637-75bb-4cb8-8f4d-df947e4ae5e6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 232

Reference: 1CH 23:29
Text: Both for the shewbread, and for the fine flour for meat offering, and for the unleavened cakes, and for that which is baked in the pan, and for that which is fried, and for all manner of measure and size;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:6dcc7110-172b-486f-ad68-afb2a14a7f1e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 106

Reference: 1CH 23:30
Text: And to stand every morning to thank and praise the LORD, and likewise at even:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b5907c2e-7c2d-4ca8-9875-e201ab8a7069>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 217

Reference: 1CH 23:31
Text: And to offer all burnt sacrifices unto the LORD in the sabbaths, in the new moons, and on the set feasts, by number, according to the order commanded unto them, continually before the LORD:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/23/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0c81d3b3-1a89-41e9-b219-8bcaa9cf5235>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 230

Reference: 1CH 23:32
Text: And that they should keep the charge of the tabernacle of the congregation, and the charge of the holy place, and the charge of the sons of Aaron their brethren, in the service of the house of the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:94435530-8f6c-4293-8edb-c733b33137f6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 135

Reference: 1CH 24:1
Text: Now these are the divisions of the sons of Aaron. The sons of Aaron; Nadab, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:23f253a4-a84e-4928-be34-86166ff3c31b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 155

Reference: 1CH 24:2
Text: But Nadab and Abihu died before their father, and had no children: therefore Eleazar and Ithamar executed the priest’s office.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:93103520-75e4-4880-a852-61d6483c881a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 172

Reference: 1CH 24:3
Text: And David distributed them, both Zadok of the sons of Eleazar, and Ahimelech of the sons of Ithamar, according to their offices in their service.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:95fb83fa-d3a8-47eb-9f15-f7ee5c5559ea>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 305

Reference: 1CH 24:4
Text: And there were more chief men found of the sons of Eleazar than of the sons of Ithamar, and thus were they divided. Among the sons of Eleazar there were sixteen chief men of the house of their fathers, and eight among the sons of Ithamar according to the house of their fathers.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d6e24e56-c314-4f2f-b99c-627543f51690>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 208

Reference: 1CH 24:5
Text: Thus were they divided by lot, one sort with another; for the governors of the sanctuary, and governors of the house of God, were of the sons of Eleazar, and of the sons of Ithamar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:be97407a-a675-4a40-9511-416f7e798de9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 334

Reference: 1CH 24:6
Text: And Shemaiah the son of Nethaneel the scribe, one of the Levites, wrote them before the king, and the princes, and Zadok the priest, and Ahimelech the son of Abiathar, and before the chief of the fathers of the priests and Levites: one principal household being taken for Eleazar, and one taken for Ithamar.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/24/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a2e511c8-9f01-45e7-bf23-e360aa571f29>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 92

