Reference: 1CH 26:27
Text: Out of the spoils won in battles did they dedicate to maintain the house of the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/26/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
