Content-Length: 136

Reference: 1CH 26:29
Text: Of the Izharites, Chenaniah and his sons were for the outward business over Israel, for officers and judges.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/1CH/26/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
