Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 81

Reference: 2CH 4:14
Text: He made also bases, and lavers made he upon the bases;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/4/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
