Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 92

Reference: 2CH 11:2
Text: But the word of the LORD came to Shemaiah the man of God, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:abae61ca-e155-47ce-8c79-21b5e064c9df>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 130

Reference: 2CH 11:3
Text: Speak unto Rehoboam the son of Solomon, king of Judah, and to all Israel in Judah and Benjamin, saying,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e2ae1840-eebb-4816-a94e-3de936c388b8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 242

Reference: 2CH 11:4
Text: Thus saith the LORD, Ye shall not go up, nor fight against your brethren: return every man to his house: for this thing is done of me. And they obeyed the words of the LORD, and returned from going against Jeroboam.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8f06259e-009c-4dd9-87c0-4de317073e96>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 98

Reference: 2CH 11:5
Text: And Rehoboam dwelt in Jerusalem, and built cities for defence in Judah.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
