Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 213

Reference: 2CH 11:14
Text: For the Levites left their suburbs and their possession, and came to Judah and Jerusalem: for Jeroboam and his sons had cast them off from executing the priest’s office unto the LORD:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:510d1194-afb6-4302-aba2-81b79ed4adba>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 134

Reference: 2CH 11:15
Text: And he ordained him priests for the high places, and for the devils, and for the calves which he had made.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:dbd167ef-a163-4fa7-8ce2-16487858ad13>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 198

Reference: 2CH 11:16
Text: And after them out of all the tribes of Israel such as set their hearts to seek the LORD God of Israel came to Jerusalem, to sacrifice unto the LORD God of their fathers.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cd0e1ad4-84bb-4e3b-8b65-879263599d16>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 189

Reference: 2CH 11:17
Text: So they strengthened the kingdom of Judah, and made Rehoboam the son of Solomon strong, three years: for three years they walked in the way of David and Solomon.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e6e89947-8f7e-4031-a303-4095be6423b0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 161

Reference: 2CH 11:18
Text: And Rehoboam took him Mahalath the daughter of Jerimoth the son of David to wife, and Abihail the daughter of Eliab the son of Jesse;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ce21cb1c-dcd9-4084-af19-8cf98ca20e51>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 85

Reference: 2CH 11:19
Text: Which bare him children; Jeush, and Shamariah, and Zaham.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d601fe3d-2e24-4747-a934-273e511b39f4>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 141

Reference: 2CH 11:20
Text: And after her he took Maachah the daughter of Absalom; which bare him Abijah, and Attai, and Ziza, and Shelomith.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:55bfeb3d-e185-4625-9776-5f93a4caa7c3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 234

Reference: 2CH 11:21
Text: And Rehoboam loved Maachah the daughter of Absalom above all his wives and his concubines: (for he took eighteen wives, and threescore concubines; and begat twenty and eight sons, and threescore daughters.)


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8412e7e4-64cc-461b-a3a8-3e11686a6870>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 147

Reference: 2CH 11:22
Text: And Rehoboam made Abijah the son of Maachah the chief, to be ruler among his brethren: for he thought to make him king.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/11/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:14289c36-9d81-4d69-bd98-e4e93eb94938>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 224

Reference: 2CH 11:23
Text: And he dealt wisely, and dispersed of all his children throughout all the countries of Judah and Benjamin, unto every fenced city: and he gave them victual in abundance. And he desired many wives.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/12/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e4a2cefb-1e3f-48fd-9a62-b54994f7d55c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 177

Reference: 2CH 12:1
Text: And it came to pass, when Rehoboam had established the kingdom, and had strengthened himself, he forsook the law of the LORD, and all Israel with him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/2CH/12/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
