Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 127

Reference: EZR 4:4
Text: Then the people of the land weakened the hands of the people of Judah, and troubled them in building,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3cc414e9-ec4f-4843-9a48-f024f54cb4bc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 174

Reference: EZR 4:5
Text: And hired counsellors against them, to frustrate their purpose, all the days of Cyrus king of Persia, even until the reign of Darius king of Persia.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
