Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 169

Reference: EZR 4:6
Text: And in the reign of Ahasuerus, in the beginning of his reign, wrote they unto him an accusation against the inhabitants of Judah and Jerusalem.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
