Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 140

Reference: EZR 4:8
Text: Rehum the chancellor and Shimshai the scribe wrote a letter against Jerusalem to Artaxerxes the king in this sort:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
