Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 178

Reference: EZR 4:11
Text: This is the copy of the letter that they sent unto him, even unto Artaxerxes the king; Thy servants the men on this side the river, and at such a time.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
