Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 227

Reference: EZR 4:12
Text: Be it known unto the king, that the Jews which came up from thee to us are come unto Jerusalem, building the rebellious and the bad city, and have set up the walls thereof, and joined the foundations.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:bca5884e-5cfd-484f-b7b8-3029e4236611>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 219

Reference: EZR 4:13
Text: Be it known now unto the king, that, if this city be builded, and the walls set up again, then will they not pay toll, tribute, and custom, and so thou shalt endamage the revenue of the kings.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:37192100-47ce-4749-930d-648f4179ff8a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 189

Reference: EZR 4:14
Text: Now because we have maintenance from the king’s palace, and it was not meet for us to see the king’s dishonour, therefore have we sent and certified the king;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0be8b978-607a-455a-9f75-cfd36cea5038>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 328

Reference: EZR 4:15
Text: That search may be made in the book of the records of thy fathers: so shalt thou find in the book of the records, and know that this city is a rebellious city, and hurtful unto kings and provinces, and that they have moved sedition within the same of old time: for which cause was this city destroyed.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1ca883fc-2eeb-4d83-a897-0b5535235205>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 178

Reference: EZR 4:16
Text: We certify the king that, if this city be builded again, and the walls thereof set up, by this means thou shalt have no portion on this side the river.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZR/4/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
