Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 131

Reference: NEH 3:5
Text: And next unto them the Tekoites repaired; but their nobles put not their necks to the work of their LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/3/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
