Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 119

Reference: NEH 3:9
Text: And next unto them repaired Rephaiah the son of Hur, the ruler of the half part of Jerusalem.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/3/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
