Content-Length: 200

Reference: NEH 3:14
Text: But the dung gate repaired Malchiah the son of Rechab, the ruler of part of Bethhaccerem; he built it, and set up the doors thereof, the locks thereof, and the bars thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/3/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
