Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 229

Reference: NEH 3:16
Text: After him repaired Nehemiah the son of Azbuk, the ruler of the half part of Bethzur, unto the place over against the sepulchres of David, and to the pool that was made, and unto the house of the mighty.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/3/17
