Reference: NEH 3:18
Text: After him repaired their brethren, Bavai the son of Henadad, the ruler of the half part of Keilah.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/3/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
