Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 180

Reference: NEH 7:64
Text: These sought their register among those that were reckoned by genealogy, but it was not found: therefore were they, as polluted, put from the priesthood.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/7/65
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
