Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 111

Reference: NEH 7:68
Text: Their horses, seven hundred thirty and six: their mules, two hundred forty and five:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/NEH/7/69
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
