Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 79

Reference: EST 9:9
Text: And Parmashta, and Arisai, and Aridai, and Vajezatha,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EST/9/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
