Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 110

Reference: EST 10:1
Text: And the king Ahasuerus laid a tribute upon the land, and upon the isles of the sea.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EST/10/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
