Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 138

Reference: JOB 38:20
Text: That thou shouldest take it to the bound thereof, and that thou shouldest know the paths to the house thereof?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
