WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a56b6d27-8221-4788-bdce-69023b7f2a41>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 128

Reference: JOB 38:25
Text: Who hath divided a watercourse for the overflowing of waters, or a way for the lightning of thunder;


WARC/1.0
