Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 126

Reference: JOB 38:27
Text: To satisfy the desolate and waste ground; and to cause the bud of the tender herb to spring forth?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/28
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:58b83723-b57f-435b-83e0-11edb5174a34>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 90

Reference: JOB 38:28
Text: Hath the rain a father? or who hath begotten the drops of dew?


