WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b4769a25-661b-4831-816a-447848623e31>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 99

Reference: JOB 38:30
Text: The waters are hid as with a stone, and the face of the deep is frozen.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/31
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
