Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 106

Reference: JOB 38:31
Text: Canst thou bind the sweet influences of Pleiades, or loose the bands of Orion?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/32
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:bec774d4-3a49-4b15-bee3-73598434f2ad>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 119

Reference: JOB 38:32
Text: Canst thou bring forth Mazzaroth in his season? or canst thou guide Arcturus with his sons?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:95a6ba98-d960-42f5-8c1c-46c47e4addd7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 116

Reference: JOB 38:33
Text: Knowest thou the ordinances of heaven? canst thou set the dominion thereof in the earth?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
