Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 104

Reference: JOB 38:35
Text: Canst thou send lightnings, that they may go and say unto thee, Here we are?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/36
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:426315a3-ba27-492c-8993-9973c0fb335d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 114

Reference: JOB 38:36
Text: Who hath put wisdom in the inward parts? or who hath given understanding to the heart?


