WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/39
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f6a1d25d-8adb-4e74-aee3-72dbd3f9907e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 106

Reference: JOB 38:39
Text: Wilt thou hunt the prey for the lion? or fill the appetite of the young lions,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/JOB/38/40
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
