Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 119

Reference: SNG 2:15
Text: Take us the foxes, the little foxes, that spoil the vines: for our vines have tender grapes.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/SNG/2/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
