Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 89

Reference: SNG 2:16
Text: My beloved is mine, and I am his: he feedeth among the lilies.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/SNG/2/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
