Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 161

Reference: SNG 2:17
Text: Until the day break, and the shadows flee away, turn, my beloved, and be thou like a roe or a young hart upon the mountains of Bether.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/SNG/3/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
