Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 163

Reference: ISA 3:17
Text: Therefore the LORD will smite with a scab the crown of the head of the daughters of Zion, and the LORD will discover their secret parts.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/ISA/3/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:afa15d19-d925-4a72-8bde-bd25675ca8ba>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 174

Reference: ISA 3:18
Text: In that day the Lord will take away the bravery of their tinkling ornaments about their feet, and their cauls, and their round tires like the moon,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/ISA/3/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a83a3ad4-0a77-4e0e-a5ae-5620f9b69f3d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 75

Reference: ISA 3:19
Text: The chains, and the bracelets, and the mufflers,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/ISA/3/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:baf34b9a-2e0f-458b-aa79-6450c15f9717>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 124

Reference: ISA 3:20
Text: The bonnets, and the ornaments of the legs, and the headbands, and the tablets, and the earrings,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/ISA/3/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
