Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 138

Reference: EZK 40:11
Text: And he measured the breadth of the entry of the gate, ten cubits; and the length of the gate, thirteen cubits.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/40/12
