Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 172

Reference: EZK 40:13
Text: He measured then the gate from the roof of one little chamber to the roof of another: the breadth was five and twenty cubits, door against door.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/40/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
