Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 122

Reference: EZK 40:14
Text: He made also posts of threescore cubits, even unto the post of the court round about the gate.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/40/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
