Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 137

Reference: EZK 40:15
Text: And from the face of the gate of the entrance unto the face of the porch of the inner gate were fifty cubits.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/40/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
