Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 158

Reference: EZK 40:45
Text: And he said unto me, This chamber, whose prospect is toward the south, is for the priests, the keepers of the charge of the house.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/40/46
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
