Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 159

Reference: EZK 40:47
Text: So he measured the court, an hundred cubits long, and an hundred cubits broad, foursquare; and the altar that was before the house.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/40/48
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
