Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 168

Reference: EZK 41:5
Text: After he measured the wall of the house, six cubits; and the breadth of every side chamber, four cubits, round about the house on every side.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/41/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
