Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 149

Reference: EZK 41:8
Text: I saw also the height of the house round about: the foundations of the side chambers were a full reed of six great cubits.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/41/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
