Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 187

Reference: EZK 41:9
Text: The thickness of the wall, which was for the side chamber without, was five cubits: and that which was left was the place of the side chambers that were within.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/41/10
