Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 122

Reference: EZK 48:3
Text: And by the border of Asher, from the east side even unto the west side, a portion for Naphtali.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
