Content-Length: 119

Reference: EZK 48:5
Text: And by the border of Manasseh, from the east side unto the west side, a portion for Ephraim.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
