WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:72b8fa07-dc9a-4b05-99f5-7f389de16edd>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 309

Reference: EZK 48:8
Text: And by the border of Judah, from the east side unto the west side, shall be the offering which ye shall offer of five and twenty thousand reeds in breadth, and in length as one of the other parts, from the east side unto the west side: and the sanctuary shall be in the midst of it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d042a642-6bf2-4964-afdd-6b2f139c68c3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 153

Reference: EZK 48:9
Text: The oblation that ye shall offer unto the LORD shall be of five and twenty thousand in length, and of ten thousand in breadth.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:843971ed-da35-4d08-86d5-5183f4993db9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 353

Reference: EZK 48:10
Text: And for them, even for the priests, shall be this holy oblation; toward the north five and twenty thousand in length, and toward the west ten thousand in breadth, and toward the east ten thousand in breadth, and toward the south five and twenty thousand in length: and the sanctuary of the LORD shall be in the midst thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:86ce89f0-1d56-4e4d-935f-04a4ca6b52b8>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 215

Reference: EZK 48:11
Text: It shall be for the priests that are sanctified of the sons of Zadok; which have kept my charge, which went not astray when the children of Israel went astray, as the Levites went astray.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:637f786d-8d34-4488-b95a-abfbbe03fd23>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 140

Reference: EZK 48:12
Text: And this oblation of the land that is offered shall be unto them a thing most holy by the border of the Levites.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1c763e76-f81c-4a54-9a4e-ca8a6daf1a02>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 238

Reference: EZK 48:13
Text: And over against the border of the priests the Levites shall have five and twenty thousand in length, and ten thousand in breadth: all the length shall be five and twenty thousand, and the breadth ten thousand.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cc10da78-7f24-444b-b388-98967923b845>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 148

Reference: EZK 48:14
Text: And they shall not sell of it, neither exchange, nor alienate the firstfruits of the land: for it is holy unto the LORD.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:25cc218d-d978-4ef0-9dd9-c04d2ae39159>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 236

Reference: EZK 48:15
Text: And the five thousand, that are left in the breadth over against the five and twenty thousand, shall be a profane place for the city, for dwelling, and for suburbs: and the city shall be in the midst thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a3de077d-838e-4b39-a9b8-6e7615884168>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 269

Reference: EZK 48:16
Text: And these shall be the measures thereof; the north side four thousand and five hundred, and the south side four thousand and five hundred, and on the east side four thousand and five hundred, and the west side four thousand and five hundred.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1a15405c-1fbf-46ad-89ed-b052c1f3f101>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 234

Reference: EZK 48:17
Text: And the suburbs of the city shall be toward the north two hundred and fifty, and toward the south two hundred and fifty, and toward the east two hundred and fifty, and toward the west two hundred and fifty.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:0744149f-3e58-4197-8667-3b1326f7bf9d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 295

Reference: EZK 48:18
Text: And the residue in length over against the oblation of the holy portion shall be ten thousand eastward, and ten thousand westward: and it shall be over against the oblation of the holy portion; and the increase thereof shall be for food unto them that serve the city.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ce7e96f1-90ba-4085-90c8-205e4b66b388>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 104

Reference: EZK 48:19
Text: And they that serve the city shall serve it out of all the tribes of Israel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f1eef036-cc4f-41b7-9d89-ac09f4e9ed70>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 185

Reference: EZK 48:20
Text: All the oblation shall be five and twenty thousand by five and twenty thousand: ye shall offer the holy oblation foursquare, with the possession of the city.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d23c10ef-258e-49b8-b719-6f3176b94be6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 458

Reference: EZK 48:21
Text: And the residue shall be for the prince, on the one side and on the other of the holy oblation, and of the possession of the city, over against the five and twenty thousand of the oblation toward the east border, and westward over against the five and twenty thousand toward the west border, over against the portions for the prince: and it shall be the holy oblation; and the sanctuary of the house shall be in the midst thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/EZK/48/22
