WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d998fbfd-7141-42bb-97ab-f7a4321f423e>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 179

Reference: LUK 4:29
Text: And rose up, and thrust him out of the city, and led him unto the brow of the hill whereon their city was built, that they might cast him down headlong.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/4/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4d71ca58-90ae-46e9-adec-4e4f081292db>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 81

Reference: LUK 4:30
Text: But he passing through the midst of them went his way,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
