Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 199

Reference: LUK 4:41
Text: And devils also came out of many, crying out, and saying, Thou art Christ the Son of God. And he rebuking them suffered them not to speak: for they knew that he was Christ.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/4/42
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c3bee639-947a-4d1e-b779-ca3f78d638a0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 188

Reference: LUK 4:42
Text: And when it was day, he departed and went into a desert place: and the people sought him, and came unto him, and stayed him, that he should not depart from them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/4/43
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:69039783-fc39-4068-8a86-13b391dc88ec>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 129

Reference: LUK 4:43
Text: And he said unto them, I must preach the kingdom of God to other cities also: for therefore am I sent.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/4/44
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
