Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 72

Reference: LUK 4:44
Text: And he preached in the synagogues of Galilee.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/5/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
