Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 120

Reference: LUK 6:11
Text: And they were filled with madness; and communed one with another what they might do to Jesus.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/6/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
