Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 169

Reference: LUK 13:2
Text: And Jesus answering said unto them, Suppose ye that these Galilaeans were sinners above all the Galilaeans, because they suffered such things?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:4dd4df80-868b-4be2-945e-a724cd0cb36c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 96

Reference: LUK 13:3
Text: I tell you, Nay: but, except ye repent, ye shall all likewise perish.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
