Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 167

Reference: LUK 13:4
Text: Or those eighteen, upon whom the tower in Siloam fell, and slew them, think ye that they were sinners above all men that dwelt in Jerusalem?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:aa08ab72-8652-49f4-a036-92172cf5a202>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 96

Reference: LUK 13:5
Text: I tell you, Nay: but, except ye repent, ye shall all likewise perish.


WARC/1.0
