Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 137

Reference: LUK 13:12
Text: And when Jesus saw her, he called her to him, and said unto her, Woman, thou art loosed from thine infirmity.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
