Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 176

Reference: LUK 13:16
Text: And ought not this woman, being a daughter of Abraham, whom Satan hath bound, lo, these eighteen years, be loosed from this bond on the sabbath day?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
