Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 115

Reference: LUK 13:22
Text: And he went through the cities and villages, teaching, and journeying toward Jerusalem.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
