Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 163

Reference: LUK 13:29
Text: And they shall come from the east, and from the west, and from the north, and from the south, and shall sit down in the kingdom of God.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/13/30
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
