Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 159

Reference: LUK 14:1
Text: And it came to pass, as he went into the house of one of the chief Pharisees to eat bread on the sabbath day, that they watched him.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/14/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
