Text: And they that were sent went their way, and found even as he had said unto them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/19/33
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ab0d96e6-00ee-481c-8d24-552bea4280a6>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 120

Reference: LUK 19:33
Text: And as they were loosing the colt, the owners thereof said unto them, Why loose ye the colt?


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/LUK/19/34
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:8b7ea6ff-196e-4638-a0af-ca5b57f19242>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 69

