Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 194

Reference: REV 9:7
Text: And the shapes of the locusts were like unto horses prepared unto battle; and on their heads were as it were crowns like gold, and their faces were as the faces of men.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:20be52af-4b45-4d26-ba91-bf3237609f7a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 109

Reference: REV 9:8
Text: And they had hair as the hair of women, and their teeth were as the teeth of lions.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:47011d8b-8e3b-4712-92c8-8cf036e32858>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 177

Reference: REV 9:9
Text: And they had breastplates, as it were breastplates of iron; and the sound of their wings was as the sound of chariots of many horses running to battle.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:27511896-ec36-4fc9-ab9b-bd3ea77fd5b1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 149

Reference: REV 9:10
Text: And they had tails like unto scorpions, and there were stings in their tails: and their power was to hurt men five months.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:331b7a11-5ab6-4730-8773-7c3c6ac2a681>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 191

Reference: REV 9:11
Text: And they had a king over them, which is the angel of the bottomless pit, whose name in the Hebrew tongue is Abaddon, but in the Greek tongue hath his name Apollyon.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b8956e0c-159b-4218-a114-3de0618bda48>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 92

Reference: REV 9:12
Text: One woe is past; and, behold, there come two woes more hereafter.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7fb9fdfa-5e32-4716-a8a3-2acc24e96614>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 136

Reference: REV 9:13
Text: And the sixth angel sounded, and I heard a voice from the four horns of the golden altar which is before God,


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/9/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
