Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 131

Reference: REV 10:11
Text: And he said unto me, Thou must prophesy again before many peoples, and nations, and tongues, and kings.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
