Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 202

Reference: REV 11:2
Text: But the court which is without the temple leave out, and measure it not; for it is given unto the Gentiles: and the holy city shall they tread under foot forty and two months.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d9e80aff-4fa4-4e63-a55f-57d50e25326b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 161

Reference: REV 11:3
Text: And I will give power unto my two witnesses, and they shall prophesy a thousand two hundred and threescore days, clothed in sackcloth.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2bb195c2-fc0d-4e15-84ef-fac702d3c584>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 120

Reference: REV 11:4
Text: These are the two olive trees, and the two candlesticks standing before the God of the earth.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2c0afe26-018c-4443-a997-ba4167478a42>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 187

Reference: REV 11:5
Text: And if any man will hurt them, fire proceedeth out of their mouth, and devoureth their enemies: and if any man will hurt them, he must in this manner be killed.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5a3ea033-e129-41e7-bf29-908b5dc137f7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 221

Reference: REV 11:6
Text: These have power to shut heaven, that it rain not in the days of their prophecy: and have power over waters to turn them to blood, and to smite the earth with all plagues, as often as they will.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d7cc1b24-f56e-4945-91eb-8c9410f84c05>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 197

Reference: REV 11:7
Text: And when they shall have finished their testimony, the beast that ascendeth out of the bottomless pit shall make war against them, and shall overcome them, and kill them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cf848181-bb1a-441b-82b4-ff5cc603b12b>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 171

Reference: REV 11:8
Text: And their dead bodies shall lie in the street of the great city, which spiritually is called Sodom and Egypt, where also our Lord was crucified.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9abda80f-bcf6-4993-b871-3c4b0cd9d6a3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 198

Reference: REV 11:9
Text: And they of the people and kindreds and tongues and nations shall see their dead bodies three days and an half, and shall not suffer their dead bodies to be put in graves.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:7aad0ff4-ada4-4418-bb6b-4d87da55a8e9>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 207

Reference: REV 11:10
Text: And they that dwell upon the earth shall rejoice over them, and make merry, and shall send gifts one to another; because these two prophets tormented them that dwelt on the earth.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:442968ba-0f44-4918-a689-8594a9e4ef6a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 185

Reference: REV 11:11
Text: And after three days and an half the spirit of life from God entered into them, and they stood upon their feet; and great fear fell upon them which saw them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:221dd92d-23c8-4573-9e8d-95b9758324d3>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 176

Reference: REV 11:12
Text: And they heard a great voice from heaven saying unto them, Come up hither. And they ascended up to heaven in a cloud; and their enemies beheld them.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
