Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 94

Reference: REV 11:14
Text: The second woe is past; and, behold, the third woe cometh quickly.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:b4fb7508-72ff-46ed-8990-09536ee8d2ab>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 226

Reference: REV 11:15
Text: And the seventh angel sounded; and there were great voices in heaven, saying, The kingdoms of this world are become the kingdoms of our Lord, and of his Christ; and he shall reign for ever and ever.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/11/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
