Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 147

Reference: REV 21:11
Text: Having the glory of God: and her light was like unto a stone most precious, even like a jasper stone, clear as crystal;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:69829f2f-de0e-409c-8957-9acf524ab03c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 207

Reference: REV 21:12
Text: And had a wall great and high, and had twelve gates, and at the gates twelve angels, and names written thereon, which are the names of the twelve tribes of the children of Israel:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:9988ef97-dfff-4582-b442-bbd877d03f4f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 133

Reference: REV 21:13
Text: On the east three gates; on the north three gates; on the south three gates; and on the west three gates.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:da0203a1-cb6c-4397-8da2-aa31a8de800f>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 134

Reference: REV 21:14
Text: And the wall of the city had twelve foundations, and in them the names of the twelve apostles of the Lamb.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:3a4ecd3a-7fe1-4620-be3a-95d7a7ddf169>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 138

Reference: REV 21:15
Text: And he that talked with me had a golden reed to measure the city, and the gates thereof, and the wall thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
