Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 226

Reference: REV 21:16
Text: And the city lieth foursquare, and the length is as large as the breadth: and he measured the city with the reed, twelve thousand furlongs. The length and the breadth and the height of it are equal.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/17
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:cac0aedd-1d02-45de-9325-b31b094e6333>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 157

Reference: REV 21:17
Text: And he measured the wall thereof, an hundred and forty and four cubits, according to the measure of a man, that is, of the angel.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/18
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d78c5e69-c2ac-4c1b-900d-cfc1c3fa4ac1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 128

Reference: REV 21:18
Text: And the building of the wall of it was of jasper: and the city was pure gold, like unto clear glass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/19
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f1a04cd0-5239-40d5-b584-52edc9c6f17a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 226

Reference: REV 21:19
Text: And the foundations of the wall of the city were garnished with all manner of precious stones. The first foundation was jasper; the second, sapphire; the third, a chalcedony; the fourth, an emerald;


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/20
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:66b9717f-7422-4eeb-9415-627fd2ec5dcb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 210

Reference: REV 21:20
Text: The fifth, sardonyx; the sixth, sardius; the seventh, chrysolyte; the eighth, beryl; the ninth, a topaz; the tenth, a chrysoprasus; the eleventh, a jacinth; the twelfth, an amethyst.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/21
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:98fca4dc-2ee2-4002-9194-0a70e037dda1>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 177

Reference: REV 21:21
Text: And the twelve gates were twelve pearls: every several gate was of one pearl: and the street of the city was pure gold, as it were transparent glass.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/22
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
