Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 117

Reference: REV 21:22
Text: And I saw no temple therein: for the Lord God Almighty and the Lamb are the temple of it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/23
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:579d0d6a-0361-44a8-9884-f2422fa6899d>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 173

Reference: REV 21:23
Text: And the city had no need of the sun, neither of the moon, to shine in it: for the glory of God did lighten it, and the Lamb is the light thereof.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/24
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:2a9c6727-14ab-423f-a77f-38d58cd36dc0>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: REV 21:24
Text: And the nations of them which are saved shall walk in the light of it: and the kings of the earth do bring their glory and honour into it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/25
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f4377ef7-650a-437d-ae1b-ca292d38bae7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 115

Reference: REV 21:25
Text: And the gates of it shall not be shut at all by day: for there shall be no night there.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/26
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:40e753ee-5242-4fcb-ba44-2aa8b2a88ecc>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 93

Reference: REV 21:26
Text: And they shall bring the glory and honour of the nations into it.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/21/27
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:5605daf8-7bbc-4ccd-9dbf-2434d629bda7>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 207

Reference: REV 21:27
Text: And there shall in no wise enter into it any thing that defileth, neither whatsoever worketh abomination, or maketh a lie: but they which are written in the Lamb’s book of life.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/1
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:feeac455-80bb-495f-9884-b2d786859d6a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 145

Reference: REV 22:1
Text: And he shewed me a pure river of water of life, clear as crystal, proceeding out of the throne of God and of the Lamb.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/2
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:80e169cc-1f1e-413f-84ac-506ce3e54a77>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 256

Reference: REV 22:2
Text: In the midst of the street of it, and on either side of the river, was there the tree of life, which bare twelve manner of fruits, and yielded her fruit every month: and the leaves of the tree were for the healing of the nations.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/3
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:90624ffb-223e-4044-8eea-6de9d619d58a>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 148

Reference: REV 22:3
Text: And there shall be no more curse: but the throne of God and of the Lamb shall be in it; and his servants shall serve him:


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/4
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e198cf72-79a6-4c95-b367-f2e00952a778>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 97

Reference: REV 22:4
Text: And they shall see his face; and his name shall be in their foreheads.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/5
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:ec21e2fc-dd60-4101-8a2d-fc9d94466aea>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 188

Reference: REV 22:5
Text: And there shall be no night there; and they need no candle, neither light of the sun; for the Lord God giveth them light: and they shall reign for ever and ever.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/6
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:312448dc-6195-410c-8391-86797c5485f5>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 202

Reference: REV 22:6
Text: And he said unto me, These sayings are faithful and true: and the Lord God of the holy prophets sent his angel to shew unto his servants the things which must shortly be done.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/7
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e1244b9e-36b8-493b-80f6-ede69141cccb>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 119

Reference: REV 22:7
Text: Behold, I come quickly: blessed is he that keepeth the sayings of the prophecy of this book.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/8
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:e65351cc-f8cc-4962-a2e8-a88fce893693>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 184

Reference: REV 22:8
Text: And I John saw these things, and heard them. And when I had heard and seen, I fell down to worship before the feet of the angel which shewed me these things.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/9
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:63c7b503-10b8-40ab-951d-1a3684519f18>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 193

Reference: REV 22:9
Text: Then saith he unto me, See thou do it not: for I am thy fellowservant, and of thy brethren the prophets, and of them which keep the sayings of this book: worship God.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/10
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:d9a81a1d-d3f5-4877-a1b7-4d58601b4765>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 125

Reference: REV 22:10
Text: And he saith unto me, Seal not the sayings of the prophecy of this book: for the time is at hand.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/11
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:efbc6139-c1c3-4146-a06e-bf484d1b1489>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 218

Reference: REV 22:11
Text: He that is unjust, let him be unjust still: and he which is filthy, let him be filthy still: and he that is righteous, let him be righteous still: and he that is holy, let him be holy still.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/12
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:c30213b8-d67c-4b9a-be41-04cff9de196c>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 132

Reference: REV 22:12
Text: And, behold, I come quickly; and my reward is with me, to give every man according as his work shall be.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/13
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:a55e4a9f-a9a2-4099-bea6-b43edd4eb747>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 100

Reference: REV 22:13
Text: I am Alpha and Omega, the beginning and the end, the first and the last.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/14
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:1b1b52b2-db3c-43d0-9b28-7ad89199ec69>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 166

Reference: REV 22:14
Text: Blessed are they that do his commandments, that they may have right to the tree of life, and may enter in through the gates into the city.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/15
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f21edd90-a2a1-4293-b376-dd4a6c3e4a03>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 151

Reference: REV 22:15
Text: For without are dogs, and sorcerers, and whoremongers, and murderers, and idolaters, and whosoever loveth and maketh a lie.


WARC/1.0
WARC-Type: resource
WARC-Target-URI: http://bible.org/REV/22/16
WARC-Date: 2026-05-04T00:56:34Z
WARC-Record-ID: <urn:uuid:f0e453ae-f714-4a8a-850b-7bd7343a1371>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 181

Reference: REV 22:16
Text: I Jesus have sent mine angel to testify unto you these things in the churches. I am the root and the offspring of David, and the bright and morning star.


